":["Cine"],"nl":["Cinema"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"pt":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"en":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"it":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"cn":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"fr":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Du 21 au 23 mars au sein du cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me, venez d\u00e9couvrir le programme du festival Contrechamps, des longs et courts m\u00e9trages, documentaires et fictions, rencontres th\u00e9matiques, performances et moments d\u2019\u00e9changes avec nos invit\u00e9.e.s.\nDans un contexte marqu\u00e9 par les replis identitaires, cette 3\u00e8me \u00e9dition du festival Contrechamps souhaite mettre en avant l'hybridit\u00e9, \u00e0 travers les dynamiques qui transcendent le prisme des fronti\u00e8res et les absolutismes culturels.\nNous convoquons ici l\u2019Atlantique noir : culture plurielle, entre enracinement et cheminement, qui n'est ni sp\u00e9cifiquement africaine, cara\u00efbe, europ\u00e9enne ou am\u00e9ricaine, mais tout cela \u00e0 la fois. Un r\u00e9seau de diasporas s\u2019articulant autour de l\u2019Atlantique, n\u00e9 sous la domination coloniale, les affres de l'esclavage, dans les m\u00e9andres de l\u2019exil, les formes de r\u00e9sistance, la circulation de contre-cultures et la transmission.\nLes multiples trajectoires des diasporas noires entre l\u2019Afrique, l\u2019Europe et les Am\u00e9riques charrient d\u2019innombrables r\u00e9cits, r\u00e9alit\u00e9s et possibles. La s\u00e9lection de films que nous vous proposons puise dans ce vaste espace g\u00e9ographique et temporel, inclassable et mouvant, o\u00f9 se croisent l\u2019intime et l\u2019exp\u00e9rience collective.\nPour cette troisi\u00e8me \u00e9dition, le public aura l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 de d\u00e9couvrir plusieurs films prim\u00e9s :\n\nVendredi 21\/03 19h\nShowcase + NWA de Hans Augustave (Ha\u00efti\/USA, 2024, 20') + KITE ZO A de Kaveh Nabatian (Ha\u00efti\/Canada, 2022, 68')\n\nSamedi 22\/03\n11h : NAYOLA film d'animation de Jos\u00e9 Miguel Ribeiro (Angola, 22, 82')\n\n13h : REWIND AND PLAY d'Alain Gomis (All\/France, 2022, 66') + DES REVES EN BATEAUX PAPIERS de Samuel Suffren (Ha\u00efti, 2024, 20') + SIRENES de Sarah Mall\u00e9on, (Martinique, 2024, 16')\n\n15h30 : A PLACE CALLED JAMAICA conf\u00e9rence de Pierre Duruisseau\n\n18h : KOUTE VWA (Belgique\/France, 2024, 77') & Rencontre avec Maxime Jean-Baptiste\n\n20h : Showcase ALICE SINEPHRO +\n21h : GETTING IT BACK THE STORY OF CYMANDE de Tim Mackenzie-Smith\n(Royaume-Uni, 2022, 89')\n23h : Dj set 22heures30\n\nDimanche 23\/03\n11h : WEST INDIES ou les n\u00e8gres marrons de la libert\u00e9 de Med Hondo (Mauritanie\/Alg\u00e9rie, France, 1979,110') + \u00e9change avec Annabelle Aventurin\n\n14h : W XOOL pr\u00e9sente ATOPIAS : THE HOMELESS WANDERER de Daniela Yohannes (Guadeloupe, 2023 27') + LE ROI N'EST PAS MON COUSIN d' Annabelle Aventurin (Guadeloupe, 2022, 30') + WHERE DO I BELONG ? de Jordie Koko (Belgique-B\u00e9nin, 2024, 24') + MATER - MOTHER LAND de Kantarama Gahigiri (Rwanda, Suisse, 2023, 10') + ATLANTIQUES de Mati Diop (France\/S\u00e9n\u00e9gal, 2009, 16')\n\n16h30 : HANAMI de Denise Fernandes (Cap-Vert, 2024, 95')\n\n18h : LES RESQUILLEURS (France, 2024, 35') & Rencontre avec Ozal Emier et Ga\u00ebl Kamilindi + OMI NOBU de Yuri Carlos Ceuninck (Cap-Vert\/Belgique, 2023, 64')\n\n20h30 : L'HOMME-VERTIGE de Malaury Eloi-Paisley (Guadeloupe, 2024, 94')\n\nDurant tout le festival dans l'espace convivialit\u00e9 :\nVenez d\u00e9couvrir la cuisine et le bar du GODJO MERKATO proposant des sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9s \u00e9thiopiennes et le coin librairie Ici sont les Lions, librairie \u00e9phermanente des litt\u00e9ratures et diasporas africaines.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"sp":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"},"nl":{"name":"Contrechamps Film Festival #3 \u2013 The Black Atlantic","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cinema-vendome.be\/festivals\/contrechamps_2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007293"}},"place":{"id":50001746,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"www.cinema-vendome.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"www.cinema-vendome.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 18","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Waverse Steenweg","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"www.cinema-vendome.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Waverse Steenweg, 18","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Vend\u00f4me","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box