"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exposici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[41,36],"translations":{"de":["Installation, Performance","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Installation, performance","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Installazioni, performance","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Installation, performance","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Instalaci\u00f3n, performance","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Installatie, performance","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Hidden Movables de Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"pt":{"name":"Hidden Movables de Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"en":{"name":"Hidden Movables by Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":"Join us for \"Hidden Movables\", a captivating sound installation by Marco Schr\u00f6der, exploring the connection between materiality, sound, and space.","longdescr":"Marco Schr\u00f6der, a composer and improviser of electroacoustic music based in Berlin, presents a unique work built upon the resonances of various objects found in the basement of L\u2019Escaut and arranged across the space. Hidden Movables creates a living sound environment that makes use but also responds to Olivia Lennon and Jan van Schaik\u2019s architectural interventions.\n\nIn this immersive environment, algorithmically generated signals are distributed across various materials, revealing their resonant properties. The use of abandoned artifacts as \"speakers\" give them a new meaning, a new purpose. The objects themselves become active sound sources, generating unpredictable and evolving acoustic patterns. As the materials interact with the signals, the space comes alive with a dynamic, self-playing composition, evolving in real-time.\n\nTake part in the exhibition and meet the artist during our events:\n\n\u2726 Opening: Thursday, March 20 from 6:30 to 9:00 PM\n\u2726 Open on Friday, March 21 & Saturday, March 22 from 2:00 to 8:00 PM\n\u2726 Live performance \"carrier bag\" with Lisa Hoffman: Sunday, March 23 at 6:00 PM\n\nAll events are free of charge.\n\nDon\u2019t miss this opportunity to experience an installation that challenges the boundaries of sound, space, and the material world.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\nAny question? Contact us on social media! @escaut.architectures\n\nFor additional information on our events, visit our website: https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\n\nWant to learn more about Marco and his work? Check the following links:\nhttps:\/\/itemsobjects.org\/\nhttps:\/\/marcoschroeder.bandcamp.com\/\nhttps:\/\/soundcloud.com\/item\n\nThis work is supported by la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, Culture Moves Europe and the Goethe Institute.","performers":"Marco Schr\u00f6der (installation); Lisa Hoffman (collaboration for Sunday's performance)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"it":{"name":"Hidden Movables de Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"cn":{"name":"Hidden Movables de Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"fr":{"name":"Hidden Movables par Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez \u00ab Hidden Movables \u00bb, une installation sonore captivante de Marco Schr\u00f6der, qui explore le lien entre la mat\u00e9rialit\u00e9, le son et l'espace.","longdescr":"Marco Schr\u00f6der, compositeur et improvisateur de musique \u00e9lectroacoustique bas\u00e9 \u00e0 Berlin, pr\u00e9sente une \u0153uvre unique construite sur les r\u00e9sonances de divers objets trouv\u00e9s dans le sous-sol de L'Escaut et dispos\u00e9s dans l'espace. \u00ab Hidden Movables \u00bb  cr\u00e9e un environnement sonore vivant qui utilise les interventions architecturales d'Olivia Lennon et de Jan van Schaik, mais y r\u00e9pond \u00e9galement.\n\nDans cet environnement immersif, des signaux g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9s par des algorithmes sont distribu\u00e9s sur diff\u00e9rents mat\u00e9riaux, r\u00e9v\u00e9lant leurs propri\u00e9t\u00e9s de r\u00e9sonance. L'utilisation d'artefacts abandonn\u00e9s en tant que \u00ab haut-parleurs \u00bb leur donne une nouvelle signification, un nouveau but. Les objets eux-m\u00eames deviennent des sources sonores actives, g\u00e9n\u00e9rant des motifs acoustiques impr\u00e9visibles et \u00e9volutifs. Au fur et \u00e0 mesure que les mat\u00e9riaux interagissent avec les signaux, l'espace s'anime d'une composition dynamique, jou\u00e9e par l'installation elle-m\u00eame, qui \u00e9volue en temps r\u00e9el.\n\nParticipez \u00e0 l'exposition et rencontrez l'artiste lors de nos \u00e9v\u00e9nements :\n\n\u2726 Vernissage : Jeudi 20 mars de 18h30 \u00e0 21h00\n\u2726 Ouvert le vendredi 21 mars et le samedi 22 mars de 14h00 \u00e0 20h00\n\u2726 Performance \u00ab carrier bag \u00bb avec Lisa Hoffman : dimanche 23 mars \u00e0 18h00\n\nTous les \u00e9v\u00e9nements sont gratuits.\n\nNe manquez pas cette occasion de d\u00e9couvrir une installation qui d\u00e9fie les fronti\u00e8res du son, de l'espace et du monde mat\u00e9riel.\n\nNous vous attendons avec impatience !\n\nUne question ? Contactez-nous sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux ! @escaut.architectures\n\nPour plus d'informations sur nos \u00e9v\u00e9nements, visitez notre site web : https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\n\nVous voulez en savoir plus sur Marco et son travail ? Consultez les liens suivants :\nhttps:\/\/itemsobjects.org\/\nhttps:\/\/marcoschroeder.bandcamp.com\/\nhttps:\/\/soundcloud.com\/item\n\nCe travail b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie du soutien de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, de Culture Moves Europe et de l'Institut Goethe.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"sp":{"name":"Hidden Movables de Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"},"nl":{"name":"Hidden Movables de Marco Schr\u00f6der","shortdescr":"Kom naar \u201cHidden Movables\u201d, een fascinerende geluidsinstallatie van Marco Schr\u00f6der, die het verband onderzoekt tussen materialiteit, geluid en ruimte.","longdescr":"Marco Schr\u00f6der, componist en improvisator van elektroakoestische muziek gevestigd in Berlijn, presenteert een uniek werk dat is gebaseerd op de resonanties van verschillende objecten die in de kelder van L'Escaut zijn gevonden en over de ruimte zijn verspreid. Hidden Movables cre\u00ebert een levende geluidsomgeving die gebruik maakt van maar ook reageert op de architecturale interventies van Olivia Lennon en Jan van Schaik.\n\nIn deze meeslepende omgeving worden algoritmisch gegenereerde signalen verspreid over verschillende materialen, waardoor hun resonerende eigenschappen zichtbaar worden. Het gebruik van verlaten artefacten als \u201cluidsprekers\u201d geeft ze een nieuwe betekenis, een nieuw doel. De objecten zelf worden actieve geluidsbronnen die onvoorspelbare en evoluerende akoestische patronen genereren. Door de interactie tussen de materialen en de signalen komt de ruimte tot leven met een dynamische, zelfspelende compositie die in real-time evolueert.\n\nNeem deel aan de tentoonstelling en ontmoet de kunstenaar tijdens onze evenementen:\n\n\u2726 Opening: Donderdag 20 maart van 18:30 tot 21:00 uur\n\u2726 Open op vrijdag 21 maart en zaterdag 22 maart van 14.00 tot 20.00 uur\n\u2726 Live performance \u201ccarrier bag\u201d met Lisa Hoffman: zondag 23 maart om 18.00 uur\n\nAlle evenementen zijn gratis.\n\nMis deze kans niet om een installatie te ervaren die de grenzen van geluid, ruimte en de materi\u00eble wereld uitdaagt.\n\nWe kijken ernaar uit om je daar te zien!\n\nHeb je een vraag? Neem contact met ons op via social media! @escaut.architectures\n\nGa voor meer informatie over onze evenementen naar onze website: https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\n\nWil je meer weten over Marco en zijn werk? Kijk dan op de volgende links:\nhttps:\/\/itemsobjects.org\/\nhttps:\/\/marcoschroeder.bandcamp.com\/\nhttps:\/\/soundcloud.com\/item\n\nDit werk wordt vriendelijk ondersteund door la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, Culture Moves Europe en het Goethe-Institut.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaut.org\/hosting\/","email":"charlotte.doux@hotmail.fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 426 48 15","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007791"}},"place":{"id":247256,"translations":{"de":{"name":"L'Escaut","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Escaut","address_street_number":"60","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.escaut.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de l'Escaut, 60","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"L'Escaut","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Escaut","address_street_number":"60","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.escaut.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de l'Escaut, 60","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"L'Escaut","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Escaut","address_street_number":"60","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.escaut.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de l'Escaut, 60","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"L'Escaut","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Escaut","address_street_number":"60","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.escaut.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de l'Escaut, 60","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virt