,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"pt":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"en":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery is delighted to present the fourth solo show with Belgian painter Dirk Eelen in its gallery space. The exhibition features his recent landscape painting series 'We've been in these Woods'.\n","longdescr":"Dirk Eelen's most recent series of oil paintings, entitled \u2018We've Been in These Woods\u2019, features a variety of landscape scenes that evoke both collective and personal memories. The paintings engender a sense of familiarity in viewers, who often recognise landscapes that they believe they have previously visited. This effect can be compared to the sensation of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu, as if the viewer is encountering a long-held memory that has resurfaced from the subconscious. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"it":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"cn":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"fr":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":"La Husk Gallery a l'honneur de pr\u00e9senter la quatri\u00e8me exposition personnelle de l'artiste belge Dirk Eelen dans son espace d'exposition. Cette exposition pr\u00e9sente sa r\u00e9cente s\u00e9rie de peintures de paysages intitul\u00e9e \u00ab We've been in these Woods \u00bb","longdescr":"La derni\u00e8re s\u00e9rie de peintures \u00e0 l'huile de Dirk Eelen, intitul\u00e9e \u00ab We've Been in These Woods \u00bb, pr\u00e9sente une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de sc\u00e8nes paysag\u00e8res qui \u00e9voquent \u00e0 la fois des souvenirs collectifs et personnels. Les peintures suscitent un sentiment de familiarit\u00e9 chez les spectateurs, qui reconnaissent souvent des paysages qu'ils croient avoir d\u00e9j\u00e0 visit\u00e9s. Cet effet peut \u00eatre compar\u00e9 \u00e0 une sensation de d\u00e9j\u00e0-vu, comme si le spectateur rencontrait un souvenir de longue date qui refaisait surface dans son subconscient. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"sp":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"},"nl":{"name":"DIRK EELEN - We've been in these Woods","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery presenteert met groot genoegen de vierde solotentoonstelling van de Belgische schilder Dirk Eelen in haar galerieruimte. De tentoonstelling toont zijn recente serie landschapsschilderijen 'We've been in these Woods'.","longdescr":"Dirk Eelens meest recente reeks olieverfschilderijen, getiteld 'We've Been in These Woods', toont een verscheidenheid aan landschapstaferelen die zowel collectieve als persoonlijke herinneringen oproepen. De schilderijen wekken een gevoel van vertrouwdheid op bij de kijkers, die vaak landschappen herkennen die ze denken eerder te hebben bezocht. Dit effect kan worden vergeleken met de sensatie van een d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu, alsof de kijker een lang gekoesterde herinnering tegenkomt die vanuit het onderbewustzijn weer naar boven komt.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"478521646","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007536"}},"place":{"id":273385,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Husk Gallery","address_street_name":"Waterloosesteenweg ","address_street_number":"690","address_street_box":"12","email":"info@huskgallery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Waterloosesteenweg , 690 \/ 12","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Husk Gallery","address_street_name":"Waterloosesteenweg ","address_street_number":"690","address_street_box":"12","email":"info@huskgallery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Waterloosesteenweg , 690 \/ 12","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":