ation - Lib\u00e9ration","shortdescr":"The largest 40-45 exhibition in Belgium, consisting of more than 1,000 collectors' items, numerous visual documents and rare testimonials, challenges the visitor and makes both adults and new generations reflect.","longdescr":"At the site of the Royal Museum of the Armed Forces and Military History (at Cinquantenaire Park), visit the War Occupation Liberation permanent exhibition, which focuses on the Second World War. It has been open since May and offers a general overview of the Second World War in Belgium.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/warheritage.be","email":"reservation@whi.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 78 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.473120"},"it":{"name":"Guerre - Occupation - Lib\u00e9ration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/warheritage.be","email":"reservation@whi.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 78 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.473120"},"cn":{"name":"Guerre - Occupation - Lib\u00e9ration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/warheritage.be","email":"reservation@whi.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 78 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.473120"},"fr":{"name":"Guerre - Occupation - Lib\u00e9ration","shortdescr":"La plus grande exposition 40-45 en Belgique compos\u00e9e de plus de 1000 pi\u00e8ces de collection, de nombreux documents visuels, de t\u00e9moignages rares interpelle le visiteur et fait r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir tant les adultes que les jeunes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations.","longdescr":"Le 9 mai 2019, le Mus\u00e9e royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e et d\u2019Histoire militaire, l\u2019un des sites du War Heritage Institute, ouvre une nouvelle exposition permanente consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 la Belgique et \u00e0 la Deuxi\u00e8me Guerre mondiale. Plus de 1000 pi\u00e8ces de collections r\u00e9parties sur 1500m\u00b2 pr\u00e9senteront ainsi une vue d\u2019ensemble sur un pan important de l\u2019histoire de notre pays.\r\n\r\nCe nouvel espace compl\u00e8te et conclut de mani\u00e8re surprenante et innovante l\u2019exposition pr\u00e9sentant la p\u00e9riode de l\u2019entre-deux-Guerres et les d\u00e9buts de la Seconde Guerre mondiale, install\u00e9e depuis quelques ann\u00e9es au sein du Mus\u00e9e royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e mais fra\u00eechement modernis\u00e9e.\r\n\r\nD\u00e8s le 9 mai 2019, l\u2019impressionnante Halle Bordiau donnera aux visiteurs un aper\u00e7u complet de l\u2019histoire militaire en Belgique et en Europe, entre 1919 et 1945 (au total, plus de 2000 pi\u00e8ces de collection r\u00e9parties sur 3000m\u00b2).\r\n\r\nLa nouvelle exposition raconte l\u2019occupation et la lib\u00e9ration du pays (1940-1944), la fin de la guerre en Europe et en Asie (1944-1945) et se concentre \u00e9galement sur la r\u00e9pression national-socialiste, la pers\u00e9cution et les politiques g\u00e9nocidaires (1933-1945). L'exposition d\u00e9passe de loin les fronti\u00e8res de l'histoire militaire traditionnelle et accorde une attention particuli\u00e8re aux cons\u00e9quences sociales, politiques, \u00e9conomiques ... et humaines de la guerre. Il s\u2019agit d\u2019une histoire historico-scientifique nuanc\u00e9e dans laquelle les options, les possibilit\u00e9s et les \u00abchoix\u00bb en temps de guerre forment le fil conducteur du parcours. Les questions tabous ne sont pas \u00e9lud\u00e9es: la Belgique institutionnelle, le r\u00f4le du roi, la r\u00e9sistance, la collaboration, la pers\u00e9cution des Juifs, la r\u00e9pression\u2026 sont mis en lumi\u00e8re et contextualis\u00e9s.\r\n\r\nLes douze nouvelles zones d\u2019exposition sont de magnifiques exemples d\u2019une sc\u00e9nographie moderne et attractive en parfaite ad\u00e9quation avec la th\u00e9matique. Sols, murs, \u00e9clairages et vitrines cr\u00e9ent un parcours de visite harmonieux.\r\nDe spectaculaires applications multim\u00e9dias compl\u00e8tent l\u2019installation. Mais le Mus\u00e9e reste fid\u00e8le \u00e0 ses missions : les v\u00e9ritables \u00e9l\u00e9ments centraux de l\u2019exposition restent les pi\u00e8ces de collections uniques et exceptionnelles  qui permettent aux visiteurs une confrontation directe avec le pass\u00e9.\r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/warheritage.be","email":"reservation@whi.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 78 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.473120"},"sp":{"name":"Guerre - Occupation - Lib\u00e9ration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/warheritage.be","email":"reservation@whi.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 78 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.473120"},"nl":{"name":"Oorlog - Bezetting - Bevrijding","shortdescr":"De grootste tentoonstelling 40-45 in Belgi\u00eb met meer dan 1000 collectiestukken, documenten en zeldzame getuigenissen zet jong en oud aan tot nadenken.","longdescr":"Op 9 mei 2019 opent het Koninklijk Museum van het Leger en de Krijgsgeschiedenis, site van het War Heritage Institute, de deuren van zijn gloednieuwe permanente tentoonstelling over Belgi\u00eb en de Tweede Wereldoorlog. Met meer dan 1000 collectiestukken verspreid over bijna 1500 m2 brengt de nieuwe expositie een overzicht van de meest beladen periode uit de Belgische geschiedenis.\r\n\r\nDe nieuwe tentoonstelling vormt het even langverwacht als vernieuwend slot op de bestaande museale opstelling over de Tweede Wereldoorlog, die al enkele jaren was opgesteld in het Legermuseum en de voorbije maanden eveneens een opfrisbeurt kreeg. In de majestueuze Bordiauhal krijgt de bezoeker vanaf 9 mei een totaaloverzicht van de oorlogsgeschiedenis in Belgi\u00eb (en Europa) tussen 1919 en 1945 gepresenteerd (2000 collectiestukken op 3000m\u00b2). \r\n\r\nDe nieuwe expositie vertelt het verhaal van de bezetting en bevrijding van het land (1940-1944), het einde van de oorlog in Europa en Azi\u00eb (1944-1945) en staat ook stil bij de nationaalsocialistische repressie-, vervolgings- en genocidaire politiek (1933-1945). De tentoonstelling kleurt ver buiten de lijntjes van de traditionele militaire geschiedenis en besteedt ruim aandacht aan de sociale, politieke, economische\u2026 en menselijke gevolgen van de oorlog. Het is een genuanceerd, historisch-wetenschappelijk verhaal waarbij de opties, mogelijkheden en \u2018keuzes\u2019 in oorlogstijd de rode draad doorheen het parcours vormen. Van taboes is geen sprake: politiek Belgi\u00eb, de rol van de koning, het verzet, de collaboratie, de Jodenvervolging, de repressie\u2026 worden tegen het licht gehouden en gekaderd binnen de bredere (Europese) oorlogscontext. \r\n\r\nDe twaalf nieuwe tentoonstellingszalen zijn pareltjes totaalscenografie. Vloeren, wanden, plafonds, verlichting, toonkasten\u2026 zijn perfect op elkaar afgestemd en cre\u00ebren de nodige rust en ruimte in het parcours. Spectaculaire multimediatoepassingen maken de vormgeving af. Naar de traditie van het Koninklijk Legermuseum blijven de unieke collectiestukken centraal staan: hun geschiedenis en relevantie worden toegelicht en geplaatst binnen het bredere verhaal van de tentoonstelling. \r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/warheritage.be","email":"reservation@whi.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 78 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.473120"}},"place":{"id":555,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Mais de dez s\u00e9culos de hist\u00f3ria e de t\u00e9cnicas militares passaram em revista por este museu. A\u00ed encontramos toda a pan\u00f3plia de guerra, da Idade M\u00e9dia \u00e0 \u00e9poca contempor\u00e2nea: armaduras medievais, armas de fogo, avi\u00f5es, carros blindados contempor\u00e2neos, uniformes e penteados militares\u2026\r\nDesde 1 de maio de 2017, o Museu Real das For\u00e7as Armadas e da Hist\u00f3ria Militar pertence ao War Heritage Institute, a nova institui\u00e7\u00e3o de refer\u00eancia para o patrim\u00f3nio militar e a mem\u00f3ria na B\u00e9lgica.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Royal Military Museum)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Here you\u2019ll find medieval armour and souvenirs from the Napoleonic campaigns, as well as a hundred or so aircraft and armoured vehicles from the two Great Wars. A breathtaking panoramic view awaits you at the top of the Arcade.\r\n\r\nSince May 1, 2017 the Royal Military Museum is part of the War Heritage Institute, the new reference institution for military heritage and remembrance in Belgium. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Mus\u00e9e Royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Plus de dix si\u00e8cles d\u2019histoire et de techniques militaires sont pass\u00e9s en revue dans ce mus\u00e9e. On y trouve toute la panoplie de guerre, du Moyen \u00c2ge \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque contemporaine: armures m\u00e9di\u00e9vales, armes \u00e0 feu, avions, blind\u00e9s contemporains, uniformes et coiffures militaires\u2026\r\n\r\nDepuis le 1er mai 2017, le Mus\u00e9e royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e appartient au War Heritage Institute, la nouvelle institution de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence pour le patrimoine militaire et la m\u00e9moire en Belgique. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Real de la Armada e Historia militar (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El museo posee alrededor de 100.000 objetos(armas, uniformes, maquetas, documentos...), siendo as\u00ed unos de los museos militares m\u00e1s grandes del mundo. Encontrar\u00e1s: una secci\u00f3n de armas y armaduras de la Edad Media, una preciosa colecci\u00f3n del Imperio franc\u00e9s, la Armada belga desde 1831 a 1914 con vitrinas dedicadas al rey Leopoldo l y Leopoldo ll, el desarrollo de la tecnolog\u00eda armament\u00edstica(hacia la mitad del s.XX), la Primera y Segunda Guerra Mundial(uniformes, materiales fotos y documentos), veh\u00edculos armados y barcos de guerra. La secci\u00f3n \"a\u00e9rea\" del museo ofrece una gama completa de aviones, alrededor de 80 son expuestos.\u00a1Y no te pierdas nuestros juegos educativos para todas las \u00e9pocas!. \r\n\r\nLos centros de documentaci\u00f3n est\u00e1n abiertos al p\u00fablico.\r\n\r\nEspectacular vista panor\u00e1mica de la ciudad desde la galer\u00eda.\r\n\r\nLas exposiciones temporales pueden ser de varios temas.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Koninklijk Legermuseum)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Meer dan tien eeuwen militaire geschiedenis passeren de revue in dit museum. Je krijgt er een overzicht van de ingrijpende veranderingen die door de jaren heen hebben plaatsgegrepen op het gebied van bewapening en militaire technologie, van de middeleeuwen tot op heden: wapens, harnassen, pantsers, vliegtuigen, uniformen, \u2026\r\n\r\nSinds 1 mei 2017 is het Koninklijk Legermuseum onderdeel van het War Heritage Institute, de nieuwe instelling voor militair erfgoed en herinnering in Belgi\u00eb. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":127,"location":{"lat":50.84086428,"lon":4.39335612},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-13T11:45:06+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+0