s bunter Comic-Welten \u2013 das Moof zeigt die Comic-Helden in 3D!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grasmarkt","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Where Comics come to life !\n\nThe Brussels Comics Figurines Museum will immerse you in a private collection of figurines from the world of Belgian comics (Tintin, Spirou, The Smurfs...), American comics (Spider-Man, Batman...), mangas and many others. \nYou will also find these characters in other formats: with video games, explanatory videos or during a projection of cartoons in a period movie theater.\n\nThis immersive, sound-enhanced experience will appeal to the whole family. It will bring back many memories for adults and will also be suitable for the youngest: the visit is easily accessible, with very visual and colorful displays. Trip Advisor awarded the Moof the certificate of excellence in the year 2014 to 2024.\nIt is located in Brussels, behind the big statue of the white Smurf, in the HORTA gallery on LEVEL -1.","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BRUSSELSCOMICSFIGURINESMUSEUM&s=7723983B-17B7-C39F-56F4-9AFF016F17B9&lg=en","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Vivez l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de la bande dessin\u00e9e autrement !\nLe Brussels Comics Figurines Museum by Moof vous plongera avec ses 1300m\u00b2 dans une collection priv\u00e9e de figurines dans le monde de la BD Belge (Tintin, Spirou, Les Schtroumpfs\u2026), de Comics am\u00e9ricains ( Spider-Man, Batman, Hulk\u2026), des Mangas (OnePiece, Goldorak, Naruto) et bien d\u2019autres.\nVous retrouverez ces personnages aussi sous d\u2019autres formats : avec des jeux vid\u00e9o, des vid\u00e9os explicatives ou lors d\u2019une projection de dessins anim\u00e9s dans une salle de cin\u00e9ma d\u2019\u00e9poque.\nCette balade immersive et sonoris\u00e9e plaira \u00e0 toute la famille. Elle rem\u00e9morera aux adultes bien des souvenirs et conviendra aussi aux plus jeunes : La visite est facilement accessible, avec des vitrines tr\u00e8s visuelles et color\u00e9es. Trip Advisor a d\u00e9cern\u00e9 au Moof le certificat d\u2019excellence lors des ann\u00e9es de 2014 \u00e0 2024.\nIl se situe \u00e0 Bruxelles, dans la galerie HORTA au NIVEAU -1\n\nLe mus\u00e9e est ouvert 7 jours sur 7 de 10.30 \u00e0 18.00 pendant les cong\u00e9s scolaires.\n\nTARIFS:\n\nEnfant d\u00e8s 4 ans: 5\u20ac \nJeunes d\u00e8s 13 ans: 10\u20ac \nAdulte d\u00e8s 24ans: 14\u20ac \nS\u00e9nior d\u00e8s 65 ans 12\u20ac","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BRUSSELSCOMICSFIGURINESMUSEUM&s=7723983B-17B7-C39F-56F4-9AFF016F17B9&lg=fr","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Brussels Comics Figurines Museum, es un museo que exhibe figuritas, coleccionables de historietas, planchas y dibujos originales. Completamente dedicado al 9\u00ba arte, este museo del c\u00f3mic est\u00e1 destinado a todos los p\u00fablicos, desde los m\u00e1s j\u00f3venes hasta los m\u00e1s mayores, y satisfar\u00e1 tanto al visitante ocasional como al coleccionista empedernido de c\u00f3mics.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Waar de strips tot leven komen !\n\nHet Brussels Comics Figurines Museum dompelt je onder in een priv\u00e9collectie van figuurtjes uit de wereld van de Belgische strip (Kuifje, Robbedoes, De Smurfen...), de Amerikaanse strip (Spider-Man, Batman...), mangas en vele andere.\n  \nJe vindt deze personages ook in andere vormen: in videospelletjes, verklarende video's of tijdens een projectie van tekenfilms in een periodebioscoop.\n\nDeze meeslepende, met geluid versterkte wandeling spreekt het hele gezin aan. Bij volwassenen zal het bezoek veel herinneringen oproepenen terwijl het ook geschikt is voor de kleinsten. Het bezoek is gemakkelijk toegankelijk, met zeer visuele en kleurrijke displays.  Trip Advisor heeft de Moof het certificaat van uitmuntendheid toegekend in het jaar 2014 tot 2020.\n\nHet bevindt zich in Brussel, achter het grote standbeeld van de witte Smurf, in de HORTA-galerij op NIVEAU -1.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BRUSSELSCOMICSFIGURINESMUSEUM&s=7723983B-17B7-C39F-56F4-9AFF016F17B9&lg=nl","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":13131,"location":{"lat":50.8471316,"lon":4.3536849},"last_updated_at":"2024-11-04T13:53:22+01:00","publi