pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"},"en":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Cohen House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"This remarkable Modernist house, designed in 1928 by the architects Henry Van de Velde and Stanislas Jasinski for the industrialist Georges Cohen, is characterized by massive and regular lines on four levels. The volumes of the interior are imposing, and the spaces include original light fittings and a magnificent fireplace.... Currently an Austrian diplomatic residence, the interior decoration bears witness to the Vienna Secession.\n\nArch. S. JASINKI & H. VAN DE VELDE","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Cohen House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Cohen House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Maison Cohen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Remarquable maison moderniste, con\u00e7ue en 1928 par les architectes Henry Van de Velde et Stanislas Jasinski pour l'industriel Georges Cohen, il s'agit d'un b\u00e2timent aux lignes sobres et r\u00e9guli\u00e8res, s'\u00e9levant sur quatre niveaux. Les volumes int\u00e9rieurs sont imposants et les pi\u00e8ces disposent encore de luminaires d'\u00e9poque ainsi que d'une remarquable chemin\u00e9e.... Actuellement r\u00e9sidence diplomatique autrichienne, l'am\u00e9nagement fait la part belle \u00e0 de nombreux ensembles de la S\u00e9cession viennoise.\n\nArch. S. JASINKI & H. VAN DE VELDE","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Cohen House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Woning Cohen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Dit opmerkelijke modernistische huis werd in 1928 ontworpen door architecten Henry Van de Velde en Stanislas Jasinski voor industrieel Georges Cohen. Het is een gebouw met sobere, regelmatige lijnen en telt vier verdiepingen. De binnenvolumes zijn imposant en de kamers zijn nog steeds voorzien van antieke verlichtingsarmaturen en een opmerkelijke open haard.... Het interieurontwerp, momenteel de Oostenrijkse diplomatieke residentie, bevat een aantal ensembles uit de Weense Secessie.\n\nArch. S. JASINKI & H. VAN DE VELDE\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006425"}},"place":{"id":50002906,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison Cohen","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"60","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050