],"sp":["Cine"],"nl":["Cinema"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"pt":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"en":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":"Join us at Fungi Fest Belgium on March 22, 2025, for an immersive experience in the world of mushrooms! Discover exclusive screenings from the Fungi Film Festival (USA), attend an exciting talk by Guillaume Lopez, participate in a screen printing workshop, experience a hypnagogic lamp, and explore mushroom-themed stands. Presale tickets available.","longdescr":"Join us for a unique experience at Fungi Fest Belgium, an unmissable event for mushroom enthusiasts and their impact on our world. On March 22, 2025, dive into the fascinating world of fungi with a varied and enriching program.\n\nThe event will kick off with exclusive screenings of award-winning films from the Fungi Film Festival (USA), showcasing the beauty, diversity, and significance of fungi in our ecosystem. These unique screenings will explore the role of fungi and microorganisms in fields ranging from biotechnology to medicine.\n\nGuillaume Lopez, applied mycology expert and founder of Zenno Nature, will deliver an inspiring talk about the fascinating world of mushrooms and their potential for a more sustainable future. This is a unique opportunity to learn more about the application of fungi in nature and daily life.\n\nThroughout the day, networking opportunities will be available, allowing visitors to meet passionate professionals from the sector and discuss topics related to mycology and sustainability.\n\nVisitors can also take part in a screen printing workshop, where they can create a personalized festival souvenir. The event will also feature an immersive hypnagogic lamp experience, allowing attendees to explore meditative states through light.\n\nVarious stands will be set up throughout the event, featuring specialized books, mycelium, mushroom growing kits, and more. It\u2019s the perfect opportunity to discover new products and learn more about the fascinating world of fungi.\n\nDon\u2019t miss this day dedicated to discovering fungi in all their forms and their potential for a sustainable future. Tickets are already on sale, so book now to ensure you don\u2019t miss this unforgettable experience.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"it":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"cn":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"fr":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":"Rejoignez-nous au Fungi Fest Belgium le 22 mars 2025 pour une immersion dans le monde des champignons ! D\u00e9couvrez des projections in\u00e9dites du Fungi Film Festival (USA), assistez \u00e0 une conf\u00e9rence passionnante de Guillaume Lopez, participez \u00e0 un atelier de s\u00e9rigraphie, vivez une exp\u00e9rience de lampe hypnagogique, et explorez des stands d\u00e9di\u00e9s aux champignons. Billets en pr\u00e9vente disponibles.\n","longdescr":"Rejoignez-nous pour une exp\u00e9rience unique au Fungi Fest Belgium, un \u00e9v\u00e9nement incontournable pour les passionn\u00e9s de champignons et de leur impact sur notre monde. Le 22 mars 2025, plongez dans l'univers fascinant du r\u00e8gne fongique \u00e0 travers un programme vari\u00e9 et enrichissant.\n\nL'\u00e9v\u00e9nement d\u00e9butera par des projections exclusives des films prim\u00e9s du Fungi Film Festival (USA), une s\u00e9lection de films captivants qui mettent en lumi\u00e8re la beaut\u00e9, la diversit\u00e9 et l'importance des champignons dans notre \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me. Ces projections in\u00e9dites vous permettront de d\u00e9couvrir l'impact des champignons et des micro-organismes fongiques dans divers domaines, de la biotechnologie \u00e0 la m\u00e9decine.\n\nGuillaume Lopez, expert en mycologie appliqu\u00e9e et fondateur de Zenno Nature, partagera ses connaissances avec une conf\u00e9rence inspirante sur l'univers fascinant des champignons et leur potentiel pour un avenir plus durable. Une occasion unique d'en apprendre davantage sur l'application des champignons dans la nature et au quotidien.\n\nTout au long de la journ\u00e9e, des opportunit\u00e9s de r\u00e9seautage seront offertes, permettant aux visiteurs de rencontrer des professionnels passionn\u00e9s du secteur et d'\u00e9changer sur des sujets li\u00e9s \u00e0 la mycologie et \u00e0 la durabilit\u00e9.\n\nLes visiteurs pourront \u00e9galement participer \u00e0 un atelier de s\u00e9rigraphie, o\u00f9 ils auront l'occasion de cr\u00e9er un souvenir personnalis\u00e9 du festival. L'\u00e9v\u00e9nement proposera \u00e9galement une exp\u00e9rience immersive de la lampe hypnagogique, permettant d'explorer des \u00e9tats de m\u00e9ditation gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re.\n\nDes stands seront install\u00e9s tout au long de l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement, pr\u00e9sentant des livres sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s, du myc\u00e9lium, des kits de culture de champignons, et bien plus encore. C'est l'occasion parfaite de d\u00e9couvrir de nouveaux produits et d'en apprendre davantage sur le monde des champignons.\n\nNe manquez pas cette journ\u00e9e consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des champignons sous toutes leurs formes et leur potentiel pour un avenir durable. Les billets sont d\u00e9j\u00e0 en vente, alors r\u00e9servez d\u00e8s maintenant pour ne pas manquer cette exp\u00e9rience inoubliable.\n","performers":"Ur Square; Fungi Fest; Mycosphere;Guillaume E. Lopez ; Ashisonlex","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"sp":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"},"nl":{"name":"Fungi Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamycosphere.com\/products\/preventes-fungi-fest-2025","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007353"}},"place":{"id":50002633,"translations":{"de":{"name":"UR Square","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Couronne","address_street_number":"227","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@wondermei.be","website":"https:\/\/usquare.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Couronne, 227","address_line2":"1050 Ixell