15 personen + 5 flessen alcohol\n\nInfo via WhatsApp: +32 478 58 60 39\n\nDe vrienden van je vrienden zijn onze vrienden. Nodig je 30+ vrienden uit en schrijf je in voor onze mailinglijst om op de hoogte te blijven van toekomstige feesten via www.coeuracoeur.be\n\nBevestig je aanwezigheid op Facebook en nodig je vrienden uit.\nRSVP op Facebook: https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/2La1VvnKW\n\nDe temperatuur stijgt...\n\nDeze avond belooft een geweldige ervaring te worden met C\u0153ur \u00e0 C\u0153ur. Ben je ouder dan 30 en klaar voor een avontuur? Dan moet je hier zijn.\nTot in Oudergem.\n\nCactus Club: Boulevard du Souverain 147 - 1160 Oudergem","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/610466745028959\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007688"}},"place":{"id":264647,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"The parties at the Cactus Club (named after the song by Jacques Dutronc) have been famous for over 25 years, for their musical diversity and good vibes. There are themed evenings every fortnight. The location dates back to 1923 and started life as a casino, followed by a cinema, before finding its true purpose as a dance club. Free entry before midnight. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Depuis 25 ans les soir\u00e9es du Cactus Club (nomm\u00e9e ainsi d'apr\u00e8s une chanson de Dutronc) sont r\u00e9put\u00e9es pour leurs ambiances et leurs diversit\u00e9s musicales. Il y a des soir\u00e9es \u00e0 th\u00e8me tous les 15 jours.\r\nLe b\u00e2timent date de 1923 et a connu une longue vie d\u00e9vou\u00e9e au divertissement: apr\u00e8s ses d\u00e9buts avec la salle de f\u00eates Casino le lieu est devenu un cin\u00e9ma, les G\u00e9meaux, en '66 (Polnareff, Herbert L\u00e9onard, Julie Driscoll, Wallace Collection ... etc y ont chant\u00e9s). Ensuite c'est devenu le Canotier et enfin le Cactus depuis 1986 cr\u00e9\u00e9 par Eric Doolaege. Son associ\u00e9 Philippe Harlet fait partie de l'histoire du Cactus, \u00e9tant le Deejay permanent depuis le d\u00e9but de l'aventure il a grandement particip\u00e9 au succ\u00e8s de la discoth\u00e8que. \r\n","description_print":"* Concept\r\nDepuis 25 ans les Soir\u00e9es du Cactus Club sont R\u00e9put\u00e9es pour leurs Ambiances et leurs Diversit\u00e9s Musicales - Soir\u00e9es \u00e0 Th\u00e8me Tous les 15 jours - Entr\u00e9e Gratuite pour tous avant Minuit. \r\n\r\n* Resident Deejays\r\nDeeJay's Davy-D (NRJ Party Time), Looda et Duty Jo\r\n\r\n* Musique \r\nHits & Club Music\r\n\r\n* Entr\u00e9e\r\nTenues correctes & attitudes ad\u00e9quates exig\u00e9es\r\n\r\n* Parking\r\nPossibilit\u00e9 de se garer aux alentours du club et sur le Parking du \"Carrefour\".\r\n\r\n* Booking Table VIP : info@cactus-club.be\r\n\r\nHistorique\r\n\r\nFond\u00e9 en 1986.\r\n\r\n\"Ce b\u00e2timent date de 1923 et \u00e0 d'abord abrit\u00e9 la salle de f\u00eates Casino avant de devenir un cin\u00e9ma ,les G\u00e9meaux en 66 ( Polnareff,Herbert L\u00e9onard, Julie Driscoll, Wallace Collection ....etc , y ont chant\u00e9s ), le Canotier et enfin le Cactus depuis 1986 cr\u00e9\u00e9 par Eric Doolaege . Je voulais un nom court et la chanson de Dutronc m'a inspir\u00e9e. Philippe Harlet fait partie de l'histoire du Cactus, \u00e9tant le Deejay permanent depuis le d\u00e9but de l'aventure il a grandement particip\u00e9 au succ\u00e8s de la discoth\u00e8que. Actuellement le Cactus est toujours exploit\u00e9 par Eric Doolaege et son associ\u00e9 Philippe Harlet .\"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Souverain","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Boulevard du Souverain, 147","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Club","address_street_name":"Vorstlaan","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus-club.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus-club.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 49 52 13","phone_booking":"+32 476 61 72 75","address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Oudergem","address_line1":"Vorstlaan, 147","address_line2":"1160 Oudergem","description_web":"Al 25 jaar lang zijn de feestjes van de Cactus Club (genoemd naar het liedje van Jacques Dutronc) befaamd om hun muzikale diversiteit en goede vibes. Om de twee weken zijn er thema-avonden. De locatie dateert van 1923 en kent een lange traditie van amusementgebonden bestemmingen: van feestzaal en vervolgens cinema, tot haar ware roeping als dancing. Gratis toegang voor middernacht. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,