":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[253],"translations":{"de":["F\u00fchrungen durch Innenr\u00e4ume"],"pt":[null],"en":["Interior guided tours"],"it":["Visite guidate all\u2019interno"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Visites guid\u00e9es d\u2019int\u00e9rieurs"],"sp":["Visitas guiadas en espacios interiores"],"nl":["Interieur rondleidingen"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Roosenboom House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"pt":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Roosenboom House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"en":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Roosenboom House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\nThe Roosenboom House was commissioned by the industrialist Louis Beeckman from the architect Albert Roosenboom and was completed in 1900. The top floor of the fa\u00e7ade features a sgraffiti panel by the painter and designer Privat Livemont. The rest of the fa\u00e7ade is decorated with wrought ironwork whose design continues into the boot-scraper and the letter box. The first floor of the fa\u00e7ade is dominated by a magnificent, curved bow-window. Currently undergoing extensive restoration, this Art Nouveau building's original layout has been restored, including access to a garage in the cellar, specially requested by the client. The original interior decorative scheme, colours and wallpaper are due to be restored in the next few months.\n\nArch. Albert ROOSENBOOM, 1900","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Roosenboom House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Roosenboom House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Maison Roosenboom","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Construite \u00e0 la demande de Bernard Louis Fran\u00e7ois Beeckman, la maison Roosenboom fut sign\u00e9e en 1900 par l'architecte du m\u00eame nom. Surmont\u00e9e au dernier \u00e9tage d'un sgraffite de l'artiste peintre et d\u00e9corateur Privat Livemont, sa fa\u00e7ade, qui fait valoir des ferronneries dont les motifs sont repris dans le grattoir et la boite aux lettres, est marqu\u00e9e au premier \u00e9tage par un magnifique bow-window courbe. Habit\u00e9e par une famille depuis septembre 2024 et apr\u00e8s une longue restauration, cette \u0153uvre de style Art nouveau vient de retrouver sa disposition originelle, avec son acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une \u00ab r\u00e9serve pour automobile \u00bb pr\u00e9vue par le commanditaire tandis que les papiers peints du 1ier \u00e9tage et un plafond fleuri seront, quant \u00e0 eux, restitu\u00e9s dans les prochains mois.\n\n\nArch. Albert ROOSENBOOM, 1900\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Roosenboom House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Woning Roosenboom","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\nHuis Roosenboom kwam er op vraag van de industrieel Louis Beeckman. Het draagt de naam van de architect die het in 1900 bouwde. De gevel is op de bovenste verdieping gesierd met een sgraffito van schilder en decorateur Privat Livemont. Ter hoogte van de eerste verdieping zit een schitterend gebogen erkerraam. De motieven van het ijzerwerk komen terug in de voetschraper en de brievenbus. Het art-nouveaugebouw wordt momenteel gerestaureerd. Het krijgt zijn oorspronkelijke indeling terug, compleet met toegang tot een 'automagazijn', zoals de opdrachtgever het had voorzien. De decoratie, het behangpapier en de kleuren van weleer worden de komende maanden deels in hun oude glorie hersteld.\n\n\nArch. Albert ROOSENBOOM, 190","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006157"}},"place":{"id":279690,"translations":{"de":{"name":"maison Roosenboom","address_street_name":"Rue Faider","address_street_number":"83","address_street_box":null,"email":"debrouximpens@gmail.com","website":null,"phone_contact":"+32 472 56 15 96","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles