"fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","pt":null,"en":"Guided tours","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[253],"translations":{"de":["F\u00fchrungen durch Innenr\u00e4ume"],"pt":[null],"en":["Interior guided tours"],"it":["Visite guidate all\u2019interno"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Visites guid\u00e9es d\u2019int\u00e9rieurs"],"sp":["Visitas guiadas en espacios interiores"],"nl":["Interieur rondleidingen"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of Tassel Mansion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"pt":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of Tassel Mansion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"en":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Tassel Mansion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"This house, built in 1893 to the designs of Victor Horta, occupies an important place in the history of architecture: it is the first manifestation of the Art Nouveau style in Brussels. All the characteristics that Horta would go on to develop in his later buildings are present in this house: the exposed metal structure, the integration of the decor with the structure, the fuidity of the spaces, the openings to allow natural light inside and the skylights in the middle of the building.\n\nArch. Victor HORTA, 1892 - 1893\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of Tassel Mansion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of Tassel Mansion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - H\u00f4tel Tassel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Cet h\u00f4tel de ma\u00eetre, construit en 1893 par Victor Horta pour son ami le professeur \u00c9mile Tassel, occupe une place majeure dans l'histoire de l'architecture et a d'ailleurs \u00e9t\u00e9 inscrit en 2000 sur la Liste du patrimoine mondial de l'UNESCO. C'est en effet la premi\u00e8re manifestation de l'Art nouveau bruxellois. Toutes les caract\u00e9ristiques qu'Horta d\u00e9veloppera par la suite dans ses autres habitations se trouvent r\u00e9unies dans cette \u0153uvre : emploi d'une structure en fer apparente, int\u00e9gration du d\u00e9cor \u00e0 la structure, fluidit\u00e9 de l'espace, ouverture des espaces \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re naturelle, cr\u00e9ation d'une serre au c\u0153ur de la maison. V\u00e9ritable \u00abmaison-portrait\u00bb, elle r\u00e9pondait parfaitement aux exigences sp\u00e9cifiques de son commanditaire.\n\nArch. Victor HORTA, 1892 - 1893\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of Tassel Mansion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Tassel Herenhuis","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Dit herenhuis, dat Victor Horta in 1893 bouwde, bekleedt een voorname plaats in de geschiedenis van de architectuur. Dit is immers de eerste uiting van de Brusselse art nouveau. Alle kenmerken die Horta daarna zal ontwikkelen, zijn verenigd in dit werk: een zichtbare ijzeren structuur, de integratie van het decor in de structuur, vloeiende ruimtes, opening naar natuurlijk licht, een serre in het midden van het huis, ...\n\nArch. Victor HORTA, 1892 - 1893","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006045"}},"place":{"id":242038,"translations":{"de":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Tassel","address_street_name":"Rue Paul Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Paul Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Br\u00fcsseler Jugendstilarchitektur von Victor Horta und UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe - das H\u00f4tel Tassel aus dem Jahr 1893 ist das erste Wohnhaus, bei dem Jugendstilarchitekt Victor Horta seine Theorien in die Praxis umsetzte. Seit dem Jahr 2000 z\u00e4hlt es zum UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe.\r\n\r\nMeisterwerk des Jugendstils: Das Maison Tassel wurde 1893 im Auftrag des Physik- und Chemieprofessors Emile Tassel gebaut. Mit diesem Meisterwerk des Jugendstils erlangte der damals 32-j\u00e4hrige Horta fast \u00fcber Nacht Ber\u00fchmtheit. Die Besonderheiten des Maison Tassel finden sich \u2013 wie so oft bei Horta \u2013 in den Details: geschwungene Fassadenlinien, gro\u00dfe Fensterfronten, kunstvolle Steinformen und Eisentr\u00e4ger, Buntglas und nat\u00fcrlich der charakteristische Lichtschacht, der s\u00e4mtliche Stockwerke durchzieht....","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Tassel","address_street_name":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Tassel House","address_street_name":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This building is considered the founding work of Art Nouveau in Brussels. It was designed in 1893 by master architect Victor Horta, commissioned by its owner Emile Tassel, a professor at the ULB and a Freemason, like Horta. A house designed to accommodate a bachelor living with his grandmother, Tassel wanted to be able to receive his friends and continue his scientific work. The principal elements of Art Nouveau are used here: apparent metal structure, integration of the decoration into the structure, large amounts of natural light, etc. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Tassel","address_street_name":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Tassel","address_street_name":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Tassel","address_street_name":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ce b\u00e2timent est consid\u00e9r\u00e9 comme l\u2019\u0153uvre fondatrice de l\u2019Art nouveau \u00e0 Bruxelles. Il s\u2019agit d\u2019un h\u00f4tel de ma\u00eetre imagin\u00e9 en 1893 par l\u2019architecte Victor Horta, en fonction de la commande de son propri\u00e9taire Emile Tassel, professeur \u00e0 l\u2019ULB et franc-ma\u00e7on, tout comme Horta. Maison pour un c\u00e9libataire vivant avec sa grand-m\u00e8re, Tassel veut pouvoir y recevoir ses amis et y poursuivre ses travaux scientifiques. Les principaux \u00e9l\u00e9ments constituant l\u2019Art nouveau sont convoqu\u00e9s ici : structure m\u00e9tallique apparente, int\u00e9gration du d\u00e9cor \u00e0 la structure, grands apports de lumi\u00e8re naturelle (serre), etc. \r\n\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"H\u00f4tel Tassel","address_street_name":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Paul-Emile Janson, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Tassel Huis","address_street_name":"Paul-Emile Jansonstraat","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paul-Emile Jansonstraat, 6","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Dit gebouw wordt beschouwd als het allereerste art-nouveauhuis in Brussel. Dit herenhuis werd in 1893 ontworpen door de architect Victor Horta in opdracht van de eigenaar Emile Tassel, professor aan de ULB en vrijmetselaar, net als Horta. Het uitgangspunt? Een huis voor een vrijgezel die bij zijn grootmoeder woonde. Tassel wilde zijn vrienden kunnen ontvangen en zijn wetenschappelijk werk kunnen voortzetten. De belangrijkste elementen van de art nouveau werden hier reeds toegepast: schijnbare metalen structuur, integratie van de decoratie in de structuur, grote hoeveelheden natuurlijk licht (serre), enzovoort. \r\n\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[10],"translations":{"de":["Louise"],"pt":[null],"en":["Louise"],"it":["Louise"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Louise"],"sp":["Louise"],"nl":["Louiza"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":4484,"location":{"lat":50.82779389,"lon":4.36197095},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-08-09T11:32:41+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:17:26+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":267246,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels ist ein Zusammenschluss von Vereinen, die qualitativ hochwertige Stadtf\u00fchrungen in der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt organisieren.\r\nDie Mitgliedsvereine sind ARAU, Pro Velo, Brussels Chatterguides und Arkadia. Im Jahr 2020 hat sich La Fonderie als Partnerverein angeschlossen.\r\nEntdecken Sie das UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe, Jugendstilarchitektur, die Bauwerke von Victoria Horta, Gem\u00e4lde von Magritte, Comic-Kunst von Herg\u00e9, Streetart, Europa, Bier, Schokolade oder besichtigen Sie architektonische Perlen des Jugendstils, des Art-d\u00e9co oder des Neoklassizismus, die normalerweise nicht f\u00fcr die \u00d6ffentlichkeit zug\u00e4nglich sind. Die F\u00fchrungen werden sowohl f\u00fcr Einzelbesucher als auch f\u00fcr Gruppen angeboten und reichen von klassischen \u00fcber originelle bis hin zu vollkommen neuen Konzepten und Formaten. Neben Stadtf\u00fchrungen zu Fu\u00df sind auch Besichtigungen per Fahrrad, Bus oder Boot m\u00f6glich.\r\nExplore.Brussels organisiert unter anderem auch das Jugendstil- und Art-d\u00e9co-Festival BANAD, die Brussels Biennale - Neoclassic (BBN) sowie weitere Projekte, darunter die Ausbildung von Stadtf\u00fchrern, der \u201eVerein der Freunde\u201c und der \u201eVerein der Eigent\u00fcmer\u201c. \r\n","description_print":null,"b