s 1983, nous sommes bavards, exp\u00e9riment\u00e9s et enthousiastes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Chatterguides","address_street_name":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre, 3","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"Brussels Chatterguides : an irresistible invitation to discover and love Brussels!\nAccompanied by a Chatterguide, discover the many facets of Brussels: from the Grand Place to Art Nouveau neighborhoods, from chocolate to Belgian beers, from Bruegel to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u00ab belgitude \u00bb).\n\n-  In Brussels for the first time?  in a few hours, by bus or on foot, we will show you the highlights and let you sample the spirit of the town\n- You believe you already know the city? Let us surprise you with our thematic tours and  neighborhoods\u2019 discovery (more than a hundred!)\n- Organizing a private or business trip or event? Your groups will love our guided tours, tastings and walking dinners ... and you too because we aim to exceed your expectations and take care of everything !\nSince 1983: talkative, experienced and enthusiastic.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Brussel Babbelt","address_street_name":"Ter Kamerenboslaan","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselbabbelt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselbabbelt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermaal-Bosvoorde","address_line1":"Ter Kamerenboslaan, 3","address_line2":"1170 Watermaal-Bosvoorde","description_web":"Brussels Chatterguides : een onweerstaanbare uitnodiging om Brussel te ontdekken en ervan te houden!\n\nOnder begeleiding van een Chatterguide ontdekt u de vele facetten van Brussel: van de Grote Markt tot de Art Nouveau wijken, van chocolade tot Belgische bieren, van Bruegel tot strips, proef alle smaken van de lokale cultuur (bekend als \u201cbelgitude\u201d).\n\n\n- Voor de eerste keer in Brussel? In een paar uur tijd, met de bus of te voet, laten we u de hoogtepunten zien en de geest van de stad proeven.\n\n- U denkt dat u de stad al kent? Laat u verrassen door onze thematische rondleidingen en ontdekking van de wijken (meer dan honderd!)\n\n- Organiseer je een priv\u00e9- of zakenreis of evenement? Uw groepen zullen genieten van onze rondleidingen, proeverijen en walking dinners ... en u ook, want wij streven ernaar uw verwachtingen te overtreffen en zorgen voor alles!\n\nSinds 1983: spraakzaam, ervaren en enthousiast.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":196,"location":{"lat":50.8101048,"lon":4.3968641},"last_updated_at":"2025-02-18T15:02:20+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:21+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/280d716171e6fb45bd683a6880d5b92f5d1fc13e.jpg","width":1500,"height":1000,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":1000,"oEmbed_width":1500,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Quand les Estaminets racontent l'Art nouveau et l'Art D\u00e9co","copyright":"Visit Brussels"},"pt":{"title":"Quand les Estaminets racontent l'Art nouveau et l'Art D\u00e9co","copyright":"Visit Brussels"},"en":{"title":"Quand les Estaminets racontent l'Art nouveau et l'Art D\u00e9co","copyright":"Visit Brussels"},"it":{"title":"Quand les Estaminets racontent l'Art nouveau et l'Art 