 2 ou 3 ans. Les six personnes qui bavardent dans sa salle d\u2019attente ont d\u00fb patienter de nombreux mois pour obtenir une consultation. Mais l\u2019\u00e9minent th\u00e9rapeute se fait attendre, bloqu\u00e9 \u00e0 Francfort par les al\u00e9as du transport a\u00e9rien. Devisant ensemble, jouant au Monopoly pour tromper leur ennui, les patients vont apprendre \u00e0 se conna\u00eetre et m\u00eame tenter une th\u00e9rapie de groupe\u2026 ponctu\u00e9e par les incontr\u00f4lables tocs des uns et des autres.","performers":"Avec: Christel Pedrinelli, Catherine Claeys, Maud Hanssens, Marie-Sylvie Hubot, Denis Carpentier, Daniel Hanssens, et Pierre Pigeolet\n\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : Daniel Hanssens\n\nAssistante \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne : Marie-Sylvie Hubot","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.TOC-TOC.5700001522","website":"https:\/\/comediedebruxelles.be\/","email":"promotion@comediedebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 560 21 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 560 21 21","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001522"},"sp":{"name":"TOC TOC","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/es\/visitantes\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.TOC-TOC.5700001522","website":"https:\/\/comediedebruxelles.be\/","email":"promotion@comediedebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 560 21 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 560 21 21","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001522"},"nl":{"name":"TOC TOC","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/nl\/bezoekers\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.TOC-TOC.5700001522","website":"https:\/\/comediedebruxelles.be\/","email":"promotion@comediedebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 560 21 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 560 21 21","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.570000