,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"},"en":{"name":"Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"},"it":{"name":"Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"},"cn":{"name":"Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"},"fr":{"name":"Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde","shortdescr":"A l'occasion de son ouverture, le Centre Jules Verne proposera une exposition exceptionnelle consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 Alice Guy. Venez d\u00e9couvrir l'histoire m\u00e9connue de la premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste de l\u2019histoire.","longdescr":"Le Centre Jules Verne accueille l\u2019exposition Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde. Alice Guy a \u00e9t\u00e9 une pionni\u00e8re du cin\u00e9ma, depuis son travail au sein de la Gaumont, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation aux Etats-Unis de sa propre compagnie la Solax, elle r\u00e9alisa plus de 600 films, du court m\u00e9trage muet au film sonore. Une exposition \/ animation cr\u00e9\u00e9e par Jean-Pierre Senelier, sp\u00e9cialiste du cin\u00e9ma.\n\nTickets simples : https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/alice-guy-premiere-cineaste-au-monde\n\nTickets VIP ici : https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/alice-guy-premiere-cineaste-au-monde-vip","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"},"sp":{"name":"Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"},"nl":{"name":"Alice Guy, premi\u00e8re cin\u00e9aste au monde","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001925"}},"place":{"id":279758,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"The Rahm brothers, owners of several cinemas in Brussels, opened the Roma cinema in 1933, on the site of the former Astoria dance hall, at 65\/67 Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle in Forest. In the 1950s, it offered two programs a week in a 500 seats. The cinema closed in 1960, the front of the building was converted into apartments, while the auditorium was used as a workshop. In 2022, Michel Dircken, curator of the Museum of Fantastic Art in Brussels, decided with his team to set up an art center there dedicated to the world of Jules Verne.\n\nThe Jules Verne Center is a space for exhibitions and entertainment, with the common theme of fantasy, surrealism and the marvellous. In the heart of the capital of Europe, this place dedicated to the imagination will be able to welcome plastic arts, 7th art, literature, meetings and workshops. The tutelary figure of Jules Verne, precursor writer of science fiction and great surveyor of imaginary worlds will permeate the place and its retro-futurist aesthetic.\n\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Les fr\u00e8res Rahm, propri\u00e9taires de plusieurs cin\u00e9mas \u00e0 Bruxelles, ouvrirent le cinema Roma en 1933, sur le site de l\u2019ancien dancing Astoria, au 65\/67 Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle \u00e0 Forest. Dans les ann\u00e9es 1950, il proposait deux programmes par semaine dans une salle de 500 places. Le cinema ferma en 1960 ; l\u2019avant du b\u00e2timent fut converti en appartements, tandis que l\u2019auditorium fut utilis\u00e9 comme atelier. En 2022, Michel Dircken, conservateur du Mus\u00e9e d\u2019Art Fantastique de Bruxelles, d\u00e9cide avec son \u00e9quipe d\u2019y implanter un centre d\u2019art d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019univers de Jules Verne.\n\nLe Centre Jules Verne se veut un espace d\u2019expositions et de divertissements , ayant pour th\u00e9matique commune le fantastique, le surr\u00e9alisme et le merveilleux. Au coeur de la capitale de l\u2019Europe, ce lieu d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019imagination pourra accueillir arts plastiques, 7eme art, litt\u00e9rature, rencontres et ateliers. La figure tut\u00e9laire de Jules Verne, \u00e9crivain pr\u00e9curseur de la science-fiction et grand arpenteur de mondes imaginaires impr\u00e8gnera le lieu et son esth\u00e9tique r\u00e9tro-futuriste.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Centre Jules Verne","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle","address_street_number":"63 - 67","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.julesverne.brussels\/","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Neerstalle, 63 - 67","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"De gebroeders Rahm en eigenaars van verschillende bioscopen in Brussel huldigde in 1933 de bioscoop Roma op het gewezen terrein van de Dancing Astoria in Vorst in de Neerstalle Steenweg 65-67. In de jaren 1950 stelden zij 2 programma\u2019s per week voor en dit in een zaal van 500man. De bioscoop ging dicht in 1960. Het voorste gedeelte van het gebouw werd omgebouwd voor appartementen. Het auditorium werd gebruikt als werkplaats. In 2022, Michel Dircken, conservator van het fantastische Kunst Museum in Brussel, beslist met zijn ploeg  er een kunstcentrum gewijdt aan Jules Verbne te vestigen.\n\nHet Centrum Jules  Verne zal een ruimte en plaatst zijn voor zowel tentoonstellingen als ontspanningsgelegenheid en met een gemeenschappelijke thema nl. Het fantastische , het surrealistische alsook het wonderbare. En in  het hartje van het Europees kapitaal is deze plaats niet uitsluitend gewijd aan de veelzijdige verbeeldingskracht maar daar zal ook de plastische kunst, 7de kunst, literatuur , ontmoetingen en ateliers hun gade vinden. Deze ruimte zal doordrongen worden van de beschermende figuur van Jules Verne, schrijver en voorloper van de wetenschappelijke fictie maar eveneens de landmeter van ingebeelde werelden  en de retro futuristische esthetiek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":39758,"location":{"lat":50.80845297,"lon":4.31654883},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2025-02-06T08:33:04+01:00","published_at":"2022-12-19T13:58:25+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":238111,"translations":{"de":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die st\u00e4ndige Sammlung des Museums f\u00fcr Fantastische Kunst umfasst Werke und Exponate aus unterschiedlichen Epochen, deren gemeinsamer Nenner das Fantastische, das Seltsame oder das Surrealistische ist. Diese absolut atypische Sammlung mischt s\u00e4mtliche Techniken: plastische Kunst, Malerei, Bildhauerei...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Fantastic Art Museum","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Brussels is fantastic! This museum, one of the most atypical of Brussels, presents pieces of different generations which all link to the fantastic, the strange or surrealism. Its collection mixes many techniques and invites on a journey through the imaginary. Conceived as a cabinet of curiosities, the museum is sure to offer visitors a fantastic and unique walkthrough. As would Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 or Rops, you will not be able to ignore this spooky place in the heart of Brussels!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Bruxelles est fantastique ! Ce mus\u00e9e, l'un des plus atypique de Bruxelles, pr\u00e9sente des pi\u00e8ces de diff\u00e9rentes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations qui ont toutes un point commun avec le fantastique, l\u2019\u00e9trange ou le surr\u00e9alisme. Sa collection m\u00e9lange de nombreuses techniques et invite \u00e0 l\u2019imaginaire et au voyage. C\u2019est \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un cabinet de curiosit\u00e9s que le mus\u00e9e propose aux visiteurs une balade fantasque et unique. Pass\u00e