ums","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsmuseums.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsmuseums.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 77 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Roi, 15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Museums","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsmuseums.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsmuseums.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 77 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Galerie du Roi, 15","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Brussels Museums","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsmuseums.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsmuseums.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 77 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Roi, 15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Brussels Museums","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsmuseums.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsmuseums.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 77 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Roi, 15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Brussels Museums","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsmuseums.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsmuseums.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 77 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Roi, 15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Avec plus de nonante mus\u00e9es, Bruxelles a de quoi mettre l\u2019eau \u00e0 la bouche de tous les passionn\u00e9s de culture. Que ceux-ci se r\u00e9jouissent puisque, tout au long de l\u2019automne, au moins six mus\u00e9es ouvrent leurs portes le jeudi en soir\u00e9e dans le cadre des Nocturnes des Mus\u00e9es bruxellois. L\u2019entr\u00e9e dans les mus\u00e9es est alors de max. 2,50 \u20ac. Ceux qui souhaiteraient s\u2019offrir une petite visite \u00e0 Bruxelles peuvent aussi profiter des avantages de la Brussels Card. Ce pass donne libre acc\u00e8s \u00e0 25 mus\u00e9es bruxellois et au r\u00e9seau des transports publics pendant 24, 48 ou 72h et permet de profiter de nombreuses r\u00e9ductions. Prix: 20, 28 et 33 \u20ac. Enfin, notez d\u00e9j\u00e0 dans votre agenda que le samedi 7 mars 2009, Museum Night Fever, la Nuit des Mus\u00e9es bruxellois se d\u00e9roulera dans une quinzaine de mus\u00e9es, tous exceptionnellement ouverts de 19 \u00e0 1h. Ce soir-l\u00e0, place aux jeunes talents pour une programmation unique et bien loin des sentiers battus.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Museums","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@brusselsmuseums.be","website":"http:\/\/www.brusselsmuseums.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 77 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du Roi, 15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_orde