IN EVENT\nReplay 100% hits - Back to 80s 90s 00s | Spirito [Entr\u00e9e Gratuite < 23:00]\n\nWE ARE BACK TO THE SPIRITO!\nBrussels\u2019 Main Event \u2013 Grand Opening Edition","longdescr":"FRIDAY 28th of MARCH \u2013 BRUSSELS MAIN EVENT\nReplay 100% hits - Back to 80s 90s 00s | Spirito [Entr\u00e9e Gratuite < 23:00]\n\nWE ARE BACK TO THE SPIRITO!\nBrussels\u2019 Main Event \u2013 Grand Opening Edition\n\nNew setup, new energy \u2013 BOX\/TABLE highly recommended!\n\nSPIRITO BRUSSELS \u2013 The legendary church-turned-club is ready to take you on a journey through the best hits of the past decades!\n\nREPLAY \u2013 BACK TO THE 80s \u2022 90s \u2022 2000s \u2022 2010s\n\nWHEN?\nFriday, March 28, 2025\n\nPOWERED BY:\nJust A Night\nLes Belges Jeunesses\nBalagan Brussels\nInvogue Brussels\nExpats in Brussels\nEuro Village\n\nMUSIC LINE-UP\nGiuseppe Amato\nQuentin Margery\nMadstone (Fun Radio)\nGersh\nBobounce\n\nGet ready for a night filled with iconic hits, epic vibes & an international crowd!\n\nFREE ENTRY \u2013 BUT ONLY IF\u2026\nYou download your FREE ticket on Eventbrite (before Tuesday 25.03)\nYou arrive BEFORE 11:00 PM with your QR Code\n\nGET YOUR FREE TICKET HERE:\nEventbrite Link : https:\/\/www.eventbrite.be\/e\/replay-100-hits-back-to-80s-90s-00s-spirito-entree-gratuite-2300-tickets-1279162000979\n\nAFTER 11:00 PM:\n\u20ac5 (Very Early Birds - online)\n\u20ac10 (Early Birds - online)\n\u20ac15 (At the door)\n\nREADY FOR A BLAST FROM THE PAST?\nWham! \u2013 Queen \u2013 Dr. Alban \u2013 Earth Wind & Fire\nNSYNC \u2013 Spice Girls \u2013 The Fugees \u2013 Destiny\u2019s Child \u2013 Aaliyah\n\nStill missing the CD era?\nWant to dust off your Discman & blast the best hits?\nWish you could dance in Buffalos, with a bandana & tinted sunglasses?\nLived the GOOD OLD TIMES & want to relive them?\n\nTHIS IS YOUR NIGHT. THIS IS YOUR PARTY.\n\nVIP EXPERIENCE \u2013 LIMITED SPOTS!\nWant a premium night? Book your VIP table now & party with ultimate comfort!\n\nBOX & TABLE + BIRTHDAY BOOKINGS\nNicolas: +32 472 30 97 26\nTheBrusselsGuy: +32 478 58 60 39\n\ninfo@justanight.net OR communication@spiritobrussels.com\n\nWe highly recommend registering for the Facebook event & arriving EARLY!\n\nReCall Earlier Days \u2013 Let\u2019s Make Memories Again!\n\n#BrusselsParty #SpiritoBrussels #JustANight #Replay80s90s00s #InternationalParty #BestHits\n\nSPIRITO BRUSSELS \u2013 Stassart Street 18, 1050 Brussels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1179889573618554\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007858"},"it":{"name":"REPLAY 100% hits  - Back to 80s 90s 00s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1179889573618554\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007858"},"cn":{"name":"REPLAY 100% hits  - Back to 80s 90s 00s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/1179889573618554\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007858"},"fr":{"name":"REPLAY 100% hits  - Back to 80s 90s 00s","shortdescr":"VENDREDI 28 MARS \u2013 BRUXELLES MAIN EVENT\nReplay 100% hits - Back to 80s 90s 00s | Spirito [Entr\u00e9e Gratuite < 23:00]\n\nNOUS SOMMES DE RETOUR AU SPIRITO !\nL\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nement principal de Bruxelles \u2013 \u00c9dition Grand Opening","longdescr":"VENDREDI 28 MARS \u2013 BRUXELLES MAIN EVENT\nReplay 100% hits - Back to 80s 90s 00s | Spirito [Entr\u00e9e Gratuite < 23:00]\n\nNOUS SOMMES DE RETOUR AU SPIRITO !\nL\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nement principal de Bru