2","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"pt":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"en":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":"Belgian Special","longdescr":"Synopsis:\nAna + Yek (Me + You)  follows twin sisters Sanaa and Zohra. What begins as Zohra\u2019s exploration of their Moroccan heritage gradually reveals the shifting dynamics of their relationship, as Sanaa\u2019s deepening love for Islam becomes more apparent. The film unfolds as a journey of mutual understanding \u2014 a cinematic dialogue fueled by their desire to connect. An intimate portrait of sisterly love and independence.\n\nBiography of the Directors:\nRomy Mana (1994) and Zohra Benhammou (1994) are a Brussels-based directing duo. Romy graduated in Fine Arts, while Zohra studied Communication and Journalism. They share a passion for cinema and a strong interest in the social and cultural realities that shape individuals in modern society, which led them to write and direct films together.","performers":"Directors: Zohra Benhammou, Romy Mana\nProduction: Elisa Heene, VRT (Canvas)\nYear: 2024\nDuration: 85 min\nCountry: Belgium\nLanguage: Dutch, French, Darija\nSubtitles: FR, EN, NL\n","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"it":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/it\/visitatori\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"cn":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"fr":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":"Belgian Special","longdescr":"Synopsis : \nAna + Yek (\u00ab Moi + Toi \u00bb) raconte l'histoire des s\u0153urs jumelles Sanaa et Zohra. Ce qui advient par l'exploration de leur h\u00e9ritage marocain par Zohra r\u00e9v\u00e8le progressivement la dynamique changeante de leur relation, \u00e0 mesure que l'amour de Sanaa pour l'Islam devient plus apparente. Le film se d\u00e9roule comme un voyage de compr\u00e9hension mutuelle - un dialogue cin\u00e9matographique aliment\u00e9 par leur d\u00e9sir de se connecter. Un portrait intime de sororit\u00e9 et d'ind\u00e9pendance.\n\nBiographie des r\u00e9alisatrices : \nRomy Mana (1994) et Zohra Benhammou (1994) sont un duo de r\u00e9alisatrices bas\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles. Romy est dipl\u00f4m\u00e9e en Beaux-Arts et Zohra en communication et journalisme. Toutes deux partagent une passion pour le cin\u00e9ma et un int\u00e9r\u00eat pour les r\u00e9alit\u00e9s sociales et culturelles qui fa\u00e7onnent les individus dans la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 moderne, ce qui les a conduites \u00e0 \u00e9crire et r\u00e9aliser des films ensemble.","performers":"R\u00e9alisatrices : Zohra Benhammou, Romy Mana\nProduction: Elisa Heene, VRT (Canvas)\nAnn\u00e9e: 2024\nDur\u00e9e: 85 min\nPays: Belgique\nLangue: N\u00e9erlandais, Fran\u00e7ais, Darija\nSous-titres: FR, EN, NL\n\n","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"sp":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/es\/visitantes\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"},"nl":{"name":"Ana + Yek","shortdescr":"Belgian Special","longdescr":"Synopsis:\nFilmmaker Zohra Benhammou filmde samen met co-regisseur Romy Mana haar tweelingzus Sanaa in hun appartement in Brussel. Terwijl Zohra haar Marokkaanse erfgoed onderzoekt, komt Sanaa\u2019s toenemende liefde voor de islam steeds meer aan de oppervlakte. De breuk tussen de ooit onafscheidelijke tweeling is tastbaar, maar een wederzijds verlangen om met elkaar in verbinding te blijven tekent deze autobiografische documentaire. Dieppersoonlijk en tegelijk erg herkenbaar voor wie zelf zoekende is naar een plek in een verdeelde wereld. Deze film is meer dan alleen een verhaal over afkomst; het is een intieme dialoog over wederzijds begrip, onafhankelijkheid en de kracht van zusterliefde. Ana + Yek (Me + You) nodigt uit om mee te denken over de complexiteit van liefde, geloof en familie.\n\nBiografie van de regisseurs:\nRomy Mana (1994) en Zohra Benhammou (1994) vormen een regisseursduo gevestigd in Brussel. Romy studeerde af in de Beeldende Kunsten en Zohra in Communicatie en Journalistiek. Ze delen een passie voor cinema en een interesse in de sociale en culturele realiteiten die individuen in de moderne samenleving vormgeven, wat hen ertoe bracht samen films te schrijven en te regisseren.","performers":"Regisseurs: Zohra Benhammou, Romy Mana\nProductie: Elisa Heene, VRT (Canvas)\nJaar: 2024\nDuur: 85 min\nLand: Belgi\u00eb\nTaal: Nederlands, Frans, Darija\nOndertitels: FR, EN, NL","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/nl\/bezoekers\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Ana-Yek.5700007732","website":"https:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org","email":"contact@festivalmillenium.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007732"}},"place":{"id":235577,"translations":{"de":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Architekturzentrum CIVA, das 2016 auf Betreiben der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt ins Leben gerufen wurde, vereint in einer einzigen Struktur Ressourcen, Wissen und Know-how verschiedener Br\u00fcsseler Vereine aus dem Bereich Kultur, Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Landschaftsarchitektur und Forschungen zum \u00d6kosystem: die Archive f\u00fcr moderne Architektur, die Bibliothek Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, der Architekturfonds und das Centre Paul Duvigneaud.\r\nMit ihrem kulturellen Projekt tr\u00e4gt die Fondation CIA zur Entwicklung einer architektonischen, landschaftsarchitektonischen und st\u00e4dteplanerischen Kultur bei, die sich mit den Herausforderungen der Gegenwart auseinandersetzt. Schwerpunkt ist Br\u00fcssel. \r\n\r\nDie Fondation CIVA bietet eine ganze Reihe von Aktivit\u00e4ten und Angeboten: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Orte des Austauschs und der Debatten, p\u00e4dagogische Aktivit\u00e4ten, Archiveinblicke und Bibliotheken mit knapp 40.000 Werken und Zeitschriften zu den Themen Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Stadtgeschichte, Landschaften, G\u00e4rten und urbane \u00d6kosysteme.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA is a museum, an archive center, a library and a meeting place for lovers of architecture, landscape architecture, urban ecosystems and history in Brussels. Throughout the year, CIVA organizes temporary exhibitions, lectures, debates, guided tours, book launches and activities for children. The activities are organized in Ixelles, near Place Flagey and in the center of Brussels, in KANAL - Centre Pompidou.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA est un muse\u0301e, un centre d'archives, une bibliothe\u0300que et un lieu de rencontre pour les amateurs d'architecture, d'architecture paysage\u0300re, d'e\u0301cosyste\u0300mes urbains et d'histoire a\u0300 Bruxelles. Tout au long de l'anne\u0301e, vous pouvez vous y rendre pour des expositions temporaires, des confe\u0301rences, des de\u0301bats, des visites guide\u0301es, des lancements de livres et des activite\u0301s pour les enfants. Les activite\u0301s se trouvent a\u0300 Ixelles, pre\u0300s de la Place Flagey et au centre de Bruxelles, a\u0300 KANAL - Centre Pompidou.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Creado en 2016 por iniciativa de la Regi\u00f3n Bruselas-Capital, el CIVA re\u00fane una \u00fanica estructura de recursos, conocimiento y aprendizaje de varias asociaciones culturales activas en Bruselas en los campos de la arquitectura, urbanismo, paisajes y el estudio de ecosistemas: los Archivos de Arquitectura Moderna, la Biblioteca Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, los Fondos para la arquitectura, el Centro Paul Duvigneaud y el CIVA asbl, ahora disuelto.\r\nA trav\u00e9s de este proyecto cultural, la Fundaci\u00f3n CIVA contribuye al desarrollo del paisaje arquitect\u00f3nico y la cultura urbana como base para afrontar desaf\u00edos contempor\u00e1neos, poniendo especial \u00e9nfasis en Bruselas.\r\nSiempre tiene \u00e9xito a la hora de cumplir sus objetivos y tratar con un p\u00fablico amplio (adultos y ni\u00f1os, estudiantes, investigadores, arquitectos, paisajistas, amantes de la naturaleza, pol\u00edticos, etc), la fundaci\u00f3n CIVA organiza numerosos eventos y actividades en diferentes lugares, incluyendo exhibiciones permanentes y temporales, conferencias, debates y actividades educativas. Tambi\u00e9n dispone archivos excepcionales abiertos para todos los p\u00fablicos (documentos de arquitectos y paisajistas: planos, bocetos, modelos, muebles, etc.) y librer\u00edas que contienen casi 40.000 obras y peri\u00f3dicos de arquitectura, urbanismo, la historia de los pueblos y ciudades, paisajes, jardines y ecolog\u00eda urbana.\r\nEstas actividades y materiales est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para despertar la curiosidad y el inter\u00e9s de todo nuestro entorno, ya sea un hecho hist\u00f3rico o una construcci\u00f3n.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"CIVA is een museum, een archiefcentrum, een bibliotheek en een ontmoetingsplek voor liefhebbers van architectuur, landschapsarchitectuur, stadsecosystemen en geschiedenis in Brussel. Het hele jaar door kan je er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, lezingen, debatten, rondleidingen, book launches en kinderactiviteiten. De activiteiten vind je in Elsene, vlakbij het Flageyplein en in Brussel-centrum, in KANAL \u2013 Centre Pompidou.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[5],"translations":{"de":["Flagey"],"pt":[null],"en":["Flagey"],"it":["Flagey"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Flagey"],"sp":["Flagey"],"nl":["Flagey"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1436,"location":{"lat":50.82873218,"lon":4.36569034},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-03-19T12:49:53+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:20+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":247915,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Festival Millenium","address_street_name":"Rue de la Vanne","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@festivalmillenium.org","website":"http:\/\/www.festivalmillenium.org\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 60 95","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":