Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"},"en":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The Collart-Van Gobbelschroy house at 6, Avenue des Fleurs, is an Art Deco gem designed by the architect Jean-Baptiste Dewin, who is best known for his healthcare buildings, such as the former Coppez Institute and Dr Depage's Surgical Institute. Nevertheless, Dewin also designed a number of grand private houses spread across Brussels. This superb villa is one of them, and it was commissioned by Mr Collart-Van Gobbelschroy in 1927. The facade is sober and balanced and, in a typical Dewin touch, the entrance porch is decorated with stylised pelicans. Inside, different types of marble, Art Deco furniture, stained-glass windows, door handles and even hinges combine to create a harmonious atmosphere, coloured with mahogany and jade green. A superb new addition to the BANAD Festival that is bound to create a lasting impression on visitors.\n\nArch. Jean-Baptiste DEWIN, 1928","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"La maison Collart-Van Gobbelschroy, situ\u00e9e au 6 avenue des Fleurs, est un joyaux Art D\u00e9co de l'architecte Jean-Baptiste Dewin. Plus connu pour ses infrastructures m\u00e9dicales (Ancien Institut Coppez, Ancien Institut Chirurgical du Docteur Depage, etc.), Jean-Baptiste Dewin n'est pas moins l'auteur de prestigieuses maisons particuli\u00e8res qui pars\u00e8ment Bruxelles. C'est le cas de cette superbe villa, command\u00e9e par Mr Collart-Van Gobbelschroy en 1927, \u00e0 la fa\u00e7ade sobre et \u00e9quilibr\u00e9e. Typique de l'architecte, des p\u00e9licans stylis\u00e9s ornent le porche d'entr\u00e9e. \u00c0 l'int\u00e9rieur, les marbres, le mobilier Art D\u00e9co, les vitraux, les clinches et m\u00eame les charni\u00e8res donnent un sentiment d'harmonie \u00e0 l'ensemble, le tout sur des tons jade et acajous. Une superbe nouveaut\u00e9 dont la visite ne vous laissera sans doute pas indiff\u00e9rents.\n\nArch. Jean-Baptiste DEWIN, 1928","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Villa Collart-Van Gobbelschroy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Huis Collart-Van Gobbelschroy aan Bloemenlaan 6 is een pareltje van de art deco, van de hand van Jean-Baptiste Dewin. Hoewel deze architect vooral bekendstaat om zijn medische infrastructuren (voormalige kliniek van dokter Coppez, voormalige chirurgische kliniek van dokter Depage enz.) ontwierp hij ook prestigieuze herenhuizen in heel Brussel. Een daarvan is deze prachtige villa, in 1927 gebouwd in opdracht van de heer Collart-Van Gobbelschroy, met een sobere en evenwichtige gevel. Het portiek wordt gesierd door gestileerde pelikanen, wat typisch is voor deze architect. Binnen scheppen het marmer, het art-decomeubilair, de glas-in-loodramen, de klinken en zelfs de scharnieren een prachtige harmonie, tegen tinten van jade en mahonie. Een schitterende nieuwkomer die je niet onverschillig zal laten!\n\nArch. Jean-Baptiste DEWIN, 1928","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006621"}},"place":{"id":50002936,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Villa Collart - Van Gobbelschroy","address_street_name":"Avenue des Fleurs","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue des Fleurs, 6","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Villa Collart - Van Gobbelschroy","address_street_name":"Avenue des Fleurs","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue des Fleurs, 6","