00e9e \u00e0 accompagner la libre flottaison des troncs d'arbres dans un cour d'eau.\nDepuis quelques ann\u00e9es, c'est aussi un groupe constitu\u00e9 de quatre ami.e.s rencontr\u00e9.e.s en Bretagne, et naviguant parmi les airs et les ritournelles d'un imaginaire folklorique intemporel.\nLeur musique est g\u00e9n\u00e9reuse, personnelle, elle s'immisce dans les interstices du jazz, des musiques traditionnelles et improvis\u00e9es. La texture sonore de la Drave emprunte celle du bois flott\u00e9, sculpt\u00e9 par les courants, les vents et les mar\u00e9es.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cafe-roskam.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006988"},"sp":{"name":"La Drave (FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cafe-roskam.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006988"},"nl":{"name":"La Drave (FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":"Zden\u011bk Tom\u00e1nek - Saxophone soprano\nVincent Audusseau - Rhodes, harmoniums\nBasile Tuauden - Basse \u00e9lectrique\nZo\u00efa Tescher - Batterie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cafe-roskam.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006988"}},"place":{"id":243287,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 Roskam","address_street_name":"Rue de Flandre","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":null,"email":"roskambrussels@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.cafe-roskam.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 51 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Flandre, 9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein Caf\u00e9, das insbesondere f\u00fcr seine erlesene Ausw