dung von Stadtf\u00fchrern, der \u201eVerein der Freunde\u201c und der \u201eVerein der Eigent\u00fcmer\u201c. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels is a network of guided tour associations in Brussels. This organisation includes ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie and Korei. Events are organised in co-production with these 6 companies. Individual or group tours are available on foot, by bike, by bus and by boat.  Visitors discover UNESCO heritage, Magritte, art deco, chocolate and much more. Explore.Brussels also organises Brussels festivals and other large-scale projects.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue Brugmann, 405","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Explore.Brussels est un r\u00e9seau d'associations de visites guid\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles. Cet organisme regroupe notamment ARAU, Arkadia, Bruxelles Bavard, Pro Velo, La Fonderie et Korei. les \u00e9v\u00e9nements sont organis\u00e9s en coproduction avec ces 6 entreprises  Les visites individuelles ou en groupe sont disponibles \u00e0 pied, \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, en car et en bateau.  Les visiteurs partent \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du patrimoine de l'UNESCO, de Magritte, de l'art d\u00e9co, du chocolat et bien plus encore. Explore.Brussels organise \u00e9galement des festivals bruxellois et d'autres projets de grande envergure.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Explore.brussels ","address_street_name":"Avenue Brugmann","address_street_number":"405","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@explore.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.explor