ing and much more! \n Young and old, don't miss this vibrant celebration!\n.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007120"},"it":{"name":"stival of the Music and Creativity of the African Peoples and their Diasporas","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007120"},"cn":{"name":"stival of the Music and Creativity of the African Peoples and their Diasporas","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007120"},"fr":{"name":"Festival des musiques et cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9s des peuples africains et de leurs diasporas","shortdescr":"Festival des musiques et cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9s des peuples africains et de leurs diasporas 2025** \n.\nPr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 vivre une exp\u00e9rience inoubliable du **20 au 23 mars** !\nRejoignez-nous pour c\u00e9l\u00e9brer la richesse et la diversit\u00e9 de la culture africaine \u00e0 travers la musique, la litt\u00e9rature, l\u2019art et la gastronomie ! ","longdescr":"**Musique**\nDes artistes de renomm\u00e9e internationale et des talents locaux se produiront sur sc\u00e8ne. \n.**Litt\u00e9rature**\nDes auteurs, conf\u00e9renciers pr\u00e9senteront, d\u00e9b\u00e2teront\n .**Ateliers et activit\u00e9s**\n Participez \u00e0 des ateliers, de percussion, de contes et bien plus encore ! \n .Petits et Grands,  Ne manquez pas cette c\u00e9l\u00e9bration vibrante !","performers":"Mpli, Sarah Carlier, Mamadou Dram\u00e9, Kabunga quintet, Celestina Jorge Vinted, Renato Martins Brazilian trio, Ekila Orlyna,  Ra\u00eessa Yoowali, R\u00e9gine Faik,  Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou, ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007120"},"sp":{"name":"stival of the Music and Creativity of the African Peoples and their Diasporas","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007120"},"nl":{"name":"Festival van Muziek en Creativiteit van de Afrikaanse Volkeren en hun Diaspora","shortdescr":"Festival van de Muziek en de Creativiteit van de Afrikaanse Volkeren en hun Diaspora 2025** \n.\nBereid je voor op een onvergetelijke ervaring van 20 tot 23 maart!\nVier samen met ons de rijkdom en diversiteit van de Afrikaanse cultuur door middel van muziek, literatuur, kunst en gastronomie! \n.","longdescr":"Muziek**\nInternationaal bekende artiesten en lokaal talent treden op. \n.**Literatuur**\nAuteurs en sprekers presenteren en bespreken hun werk.\n .**Workshops en activiteiten**\n Doe mee aan workshops, percussie, verhalen vertellen en nog veel meer! \n Jong en oud, mis deze bruisende viering niet!\n.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007120"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","addres