,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.2832581674713524,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exposici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[30,24],"translations":{"de":["Malerei","Kunstgalerien"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Painting","Art Galleries"],"it":["Pittura","Gallerie d'arte"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Peinture","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["Pintura","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Schilderkunst","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"pt":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"en":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Pierre Debatty's paintings (Brussels ,1966) are an allusion to an imaginary landscape, like a journey in which the patches of colour, bold and assertive as they are, sing the joy of life. His paintings are \"dreamlands\"; they are his own world, a kind of bubble in which he wanders alone and breathes pure air that fills him with happiness.\nMore than ever, Pierre Debatty's paintings reflect his deep concerns about the threat posed by climate change and the disruption of nature by mankind. But far from wishing to propose an apocalyptic vision of nature, the artist's intention is to present it in its combative form, supported by telluric forces clever enough to reconquer lost harmony and ultimately emerge triumphant.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"it":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"cn":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"fr":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"La peinture de Pierre Debatty  (Uccle,  en 1966)  est une  allusion au paysage imaginaire, comme un voyage dans lequel les taches de couleur chantent la joie tant celles-ci sont  audacieuses et affirm\u00e9es. \n \"Mes peintures sont des \"pays-songes\", elles constituent  mon  propre monde, une sorte de bulle dans laquelle, je me prom\u00e8ne en solitaire et respire  un air pur  qui me remplit de bonheur.\"\nPlus que jamais, la peinture  de Pierre Debatty est  le reflet  de  ses profondes  pr\u00e9occupations , face au constat de la menace climatique et d'une nature perturb\u00e9e par l'homme. Mais, loin de vouloir proposer  une vision  apocalyptique  de  la nature, le  souhait de l'artiste  est de  pr\u00e9senter celle-ci  dans sa  version combative,  appuy\u00e9e par les forces telluriques suffisamment  astucieuses pour reconqu\u00e9rir l'harmonie perdue et   finalement,  en sortir triomphante. \n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"sp":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"},"nl":{"name":"Pierre Debatty - Mythical Escape","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\nDe schilderijen van Pierre Debatty(Uccle, 1966) zijn een toespeling op een imaginair landschap, als een reis waarin de kleurvlakken vreugde uitstralen, zo gedurfd en assertief  ze zijn.\nZijn schilderijen zijn \u201cdroomlanden\u201d, een  eigen wereld, een soort luchtbel waarin hij alleen ronddwaal en zuivere lucht inadem die hem vervult van geluk.\nMeer dan ooit weerspiegelen de schilderijen van Pierre Debatty zijn diepe bezorgdheid over de dreiging van de klimaatverandering en de verstoring van de natuur door de mens. Maar in plaats van een apocalyptische visie op de natuur voor te stellen, wil de kunstenaar de natuur in haar strijdbare versie laten zien, ondersteund door tellurische krachten die slim genoeg zijn om de verloren harmonie te heroveren en uiteindelijk als overwinnaar uit de strijd te komen.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 52 62 58","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006217"}},"place":{"id":260455,"translations":{"de":{"name":"zedes art gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Paul Lauters","address_street_number":"36","a