nette humaine (1983), Messe pour le temps futur (1983), Cinq n\u00f4 modernes, Kabuki (1986), Patrice Ch\u00e9reau (devenu danseur) r\u00e8gle la rencontre de Mishima et d\u2019Eva Per\u00f3n (1988), Bugaku (1988),Kurozuka (1988), M comme Mishima (1993), Tokyo Gesture (2002)\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","email":"info@mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 230 50 27","phone_booking":"+32 474 79 20 58","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007153"},"sp":{"name":"B\u00e9jart au pays du soleil levant","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","email":"info@mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 230 50 27","phone_booking":"+32 474 79 20 58","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007153"},"nl":{"name":"B\u00e9jart au pays du soleil levant","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","email":"info@mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 230 50 27","phone_booking":"+32 474 79 20 58","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007153"}},"place":{"id":275405,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Fast 30 Jahre lang lebte der Choreograph Maurice B\u00e9jart in diesem Haus, in dem anhand zahlreicher Dokumente sein Leben Revue passiert wird.\r\n\r\nMaurice B\u00e9jart lebte fast 30 Jahre lang in Br\u00fcssel. Die Dauerausstellung \"B\u00e9jart Parcours Libre\" bietet dem Besucher die M\u00f6glichkeit, den Ort zu entdecken, an dem der Choreograf lebte, sowie eine Auswahl von Dokumenten aus einigen seiner Ballette (Programme, Plakate, handschriftliche Texte, Originalzeichnungen, Fotografien, Videos...).\r\n\r\n\"Als Maurice Huisman, der neue Direktor des Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de La Monnaie in Br\u00fcssel, mich 1959 anrief, um Le Sacre du Printemps zu inszenieren, wusste ich nicht, dass dies der Beginn eines langen Lebens in Br\u00fcssel sein w\u00fcrde. Fast 30 Jahre! In Br\u00fcssel entstand der gr\u00f6\u00dfte Teil meines choreografischen Schaffens.\" Maurice B\u00e9jart","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"House of Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Greepstraat","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Greepstraat, 49","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Almost for 30 years Maurice B\u00e9jart, one of Belgium's most celebrated choreographers, lived in this house, where there's a great deal to discover about him thanks to a lot of documents.\r\n\r\nMaurice B\u00e9jart lived in Brussels for nearly 30 years. The permanent exhibition entitled 'B\u00e9jart Parcours Libre' gives visitors the opportunity to discover this significant place where the choreographer lived, as well as a selection of archive pieces documenting his ballets (programmes, posters, manuscripts, original drawings, photographs, videos etc.).\r\n\r\n\"When Maurice Huisman, the new director of Th\u00e9atre de la Monnaie, called me in 1959 to put on Le Sacre du Printemps, I didn\u2019t think that this was going to be the beginning of a long life in Brussels. Almost 30 years! It is in Brussels that most of my choreographic creations were achieved.\u201d Maurice B\u00e9jart","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Pendant pr\u00e8s de 30 ans, Maurice B\u00e9jart v\u00e9cut dans cette maison o\u00f9 son parcours est retrac\u00e9 \u00e0 travers de nombreux documents.\r\n\r\nMaurice B\u00e9jart a v\u00e9cu \u00e0 Bruxelles pendant pr\u00e8s de 30 ans. L\u2019exposition permanente intitul\u00e9e \u00ab B\u00e9jart Parcours Libre \u00bb donne l\u2019occasion au visiteur de d\u00e9couvrir le lieu significatif o\u00f9 v\u00e9cut le chor\u00e9graphe ainsi qu\u2019une s\u00e9lection de documents de certains de ses ballets (programmes, affiches, textes manuscrits, dessins originaux, photographies, vid\u00e9os...).\r\n\r\n\u00ab Quand Maurice Huisman, nouveau directeur du The\u0301a\u0302tre de La Monnaie de Bruxelles, m\u2019a appele\u0301 en 1959 pour r\u00e9aliser Le Sacre du printemps, j\u2019ignorais que cela allait e\u0302tre le de\u0301but d\u2019une longue vie \u00e0 Bruxelles. Pre\u0300s de 30 ans ! C\u2019est \u00e0 Bruxelles que l\u2019essentiel de ma cr\u00e9ation chor\u00e9graphique a \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9alis\u00e9e. \u00bb Maurice B\u00e9jart\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Maurice B\u00e9jart huis","address_street_name":"Greepstraat","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Greepstraat, 49","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Bijna 30 jaar lang woonde Maurice B\u00e9jart, een van de voornaamste Franse choreografen, in dit pand waar hij zijn sporen en een rijkdom aan documenten naliet.\r\n\r\nHet Maurice B\u00e9jart Huis is een stichting van openbaar nut die zich inzet om het werk van Maurice B\u00e9jart (1927-2007) in al zijn vormen te laten voortleven. Daarnaast noemde de choreograaf het Maurice B\u00e9jart Huis 30 jaar lang zijn thuis. De permanente tentoonstelling 'B\u00e9jart Parcours Libre' biedt bezoekers de mogelijkheid om deze prachtige ruimte te ontdekken, evenals een selectie van documenten gerelateerd aan bepaalde balletten van B\u00e9jart (programma\u2019s, affiches, handgeschreven teksten, originele tekeningen, foto\u2019s, enzovoort).\r\n\r\n\u201cToen Maurice Huisman, de nieuwe directeur van De Munt in Brussel, me op belde in 1959 met de vraag om de Sacre du Printemps op te voeren, negeerde ik het feit dat dit het begin van een lang leven van bijna 30 jaar in Brussel zou gaan betekenen. Het is in Brussel dat de de essentie van mijn choreografische creatie werd gerealiseerd.\u201d Maurice B\u00e9jart","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[13],"translations":{"de":["Historisches Stadtzentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Historical Centre"],"it":["Centro storico"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre historique"],"sp":["Centro hist\u00f3rico"],"nl":["Historisch centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":35405,"location":{"lat":50.848661,"lon":4.353774},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2025-02-25T16:41:10+01:00","published_at":"2020-03-31T15:23:58+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":275405,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Fast 30 Jahre lang lebte der Choreograph Maurice B\u00e9jart in diesem Haus, in dem anhand zahlreicher Dokumente sein Leben Revue passiert wird.\r\n\r\nMaurice B\u00e9jart lebte fast 30 Jahre lang in Br\u00fcssel. Die Dauerausstellung \"B\u00e9jart Parcours Libre\" bietet dem Besucher die M\u00f6glichkeit, den Ort zu entdecken, an dem der Choreograf lebte, sowie eine Auswahl von Dokumenten aus einigen seiner Ballette (Programme, Plakate, handschriftliche Texte, Originalzeichnungen, Fotografien, Videos...).\r\n\r\n\"Als Maurice Huisman, der neue Direktor des Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de La Monnaie in Br\u00fcssel, mich 1959 anrief, um Le Sacre du Printemps zu inszenieren, wusste ich nicht, dass dies der Beginn eines langen Lebens in Br\u00fcssel sein w\u00fcrde. Fast 30 Jahre! In Br\u00fcssel entstand der gr\u00f6\u00dfte Teil meines choreografischen Schaffens.\" Maurice B\u00e9jart","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison Maurice B\u00e9jart","address_street_name":"Rue de la Fourche","address_street_number":"49","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mauricebejart.be","website":"https:\/\/www.mauricebejart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 31 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Fourche, 49","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"n