s:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Where Comics come to life !\n\nThe Brussels Comics Figurines Museum will immerse you in a private collection of figurines from the world of Belgian comics (Tintin, Spirou, The Smurfs...), American comics (Spider-Man, Batman...) and many others.\n\nYou will also find these characters in other formats: with video games, explanatory videos or during a projection of cartoons in a period movie theater.\n\nThis immersive, sound-enhanced experience will appeal to the whole family. It will bring back many memories for adults and will also be suitable for the youngest: the visit is easily accessible, with very visual and colorful displays. Trip Advisor awarded the Moof the certificate of excellence in the year 2014 to 2020.\n\nThe museum is located in 1000 Brussels, behind the big statue of the white Smurf, in the HORTA gallery on LEVEL -1.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"it":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/it\/visitatori\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"cn":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"fr":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Vivez l\u2019exp\u00e9rience de la bande dessin\u00e9e autrement !\n\nLe Brussels Comics Figurines Museum by Moof vous plongera avec ses 1300m\u00b2 dans une collection priv\u00e9e de figurines dans le monde de la BD Belge (Tintin, Spirou, Les Schtroumpfs\u2026), de Comics am\u00e9ricains ( Spider-Man, Batman, Hulk\u2026), Manga (OnePiece, Goldorak, Naruto) et bien d\u2019autres.\nVous retrouverez ces personnages aussi sous d\u2019autres formats : avec des jeux vid\u00e9o, des vid\u00e9os explicatives ou lors d\u2019une projection de dessins anim\u00e9s dans une salle de cin\u00e9ma d\u2019\u00e9poque.\n\nCette balade immersive et sonoris\u00e9e plaira \u00e0 toute la famille. Elle rem\u00e9morera aux adultes bien des souvenirs et conviendra aussi aux plus jeunes : La visite est facilement accessible, avec des vitrines tr\u00e8s visuelles et color\u00e9es. Trip Advisor a d\u00e9cern\u00e9 au Moof le certificat d\u2019excellence lors des ann\u00e9es de 2014 \u00e0 2023.\n\nLe Mus\u00e9e se situe \u00e0 1000 Bruxelles, dans la galerie HORTA au NIVEAU -1.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/es\/visitantes\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museums","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Waar de strip tot leven komt !\n\nHet Brussels Comics Figurines Museum dompelt u onder in een priv\u00e9collectie van figuurtjes uit de wereld van de Belgische strip (Kuifje, Robbedoes, De Smurfen...), de Amerikaanse strip (Spider-Man, Batman...) en vele andere.\n\nU vindt deze personages ook in andere vormen: met videospelletjes, verklarende video's of tijdens een projectie van tekenfilms in een periodebioscoop.\n\nDeze meeslepende, met geluid versterkte wandeling zal het hele gezin aanspreken. Het zal veel herinneringen oproepen bij volwassenen en ook geschikt zijn voor de kleinsten: het bezoek is gemakkelijk toegankelijk, met zeer visuele en kleurrijke displays. Trip Advisor heeft de Moof het certificaat van uitmuntendheid toegekend in het jaar 2014 tot 2020.\n\nHet museum bevindt zich in 1000 Brussel, achter het grote standbeeld van de witte Smurf, in de HORTA-galerij op NIVEAU -1.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/nl\/bezoekers\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.Brussels-Comics-Figurines-Museums.5700007563","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","email":"info@bcf-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007563"}},"place":{"id":251039,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Im Brussels Comics Figurines Museum, erwartet Sie eine farbenfrohe Sammlung mit mehr als 650 Comic-Figuren, Objekten und Originalzeichnungen aus der bunten Welt der belgischen Comics. \r\n\r\nUnd sie sind alle da, die ber\u00fchmten belgischen Comic-Helden \u2013 von der 2 cm kleinen Miniatur bis hin zur 2,48 m gro\u00dfen Riesenfigur - vom langschw\u00e4nzigen gelben Marsupilami, den Abenteurern Tim und Struppi, \u00fcber die blauen Schl\u00fcmpfe bis hin zum coolen Cowboy Lucky Luke und den Superhelden Batman und Superman \u2013 ja sogar der ber\u00fchmte Zauberkessel des Druiden mit Asterix und Obelix wurde ins Moof verfrachtet. Es gibt viel zu entdecken: In den nach Autoren geordneten Vitrinen werden teils kleine am\u00fcsante Szenen dargestellt, in der \u201eBar der Helden\u201c kann man sich mit seinem bevorzugten Comic-Helden fotografieren lassen, in einem Filmbereich werden Zeichentrickfilme gezeigt und im Moof-Store kann man sich mit Comic-Devotionalien eindecken!\r\n\r\nGro\u00dfe Liebhaber der 9. Kunst, kleine Fans bunter Comic-Welten \u2013 das Moof zeigt die Comic-Helden in 3D!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Comics Figurines Museum","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bcf-museum.be","website":"https:\/\/www.brussels-comics-figurines-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 207 79 92","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grasmarkt","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Where Comics come to life !\n\nThe Brussels Comics Figurines Museum will immerse you in a private collection of figurines from the world of Belgian comics (Tintin, Spirou, The Smurfs...), American comics (Spider-Man, Batman...), mangas and many others. \nYou will also find these characters in other formats: with video games, explanatory videos or during a projection of cartoons in a period movie theater.\n\nThis immersive, sound-enhanced experience will appeal to the whole family. It will bring back many memories for adults and will also be suitable for the youngest: the visit is easily accessible, with very visual and colorful displays. Trip Advisor awarded the Moof the certificate of excellence in the year 2014 to 2024.\nIt is located in Brussels, behind the big statue of the white Smurf, in the HORTA gallery on LEVEL -1.","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BRUS