ition-jean-delhaye\/","email":"culture.francaise@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 05 39","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 05 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005342"},"cn":{"name":"Expo Jean Delhaye. Architecte et d\u00e9fenseur de l'oeuvre de Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ganshoren.be\/agenda\/exposition-jean-delhaye\/","email":"culture.francaise@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 05 39","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 05 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005342"},"fr":{"name":"Jean Delhaye. Architecte et d\u00e9fenseur de l'oeuvre de Horta","shortdescr":"L\u2019Atelier Brunswyck\/Wathelet \u00e0 Ganshoren expose l\u2019univers fascinant de l'architecte moderniste Jean Delhaye (1908-1993).","longdescr":"Dans le cadre de son action de promotion de l\u2019architecture moderniste \u00e0 Bruxelles, l\u2019Atelier Brunswyck\/Wathelet accueille l\u2019univers fascinant de l'architecte Jean Delhaye (1908-1993). Stagiaire aupr\u00e8s de Victor Horta d\u00e8s 1934, Delhaye d\u00e9veloppe parall\u00e8lement sa propre activit\u00e9 d\u2019architecte en se sp\u00e9cialisant dans la construction d\u2019appartements modernes dans une veine Art D\u00e9co h\u00e9rit\u00e9e de son ma\u00eetre. Domicili\u00e9 \u00e0 Ganshoren, commune alors en plein d\u00e9veloppement, il y construira sept maisons et immeubles. Son admiration inconditionnelle pour Horta le conduira \u00e0 consacrer sa vie \u00e0 la pr\u00e9servation de son \u0153uvre. Delhaye joue ainsi un r\u00f4le primordial dans la reconnaissance internationale de l\u2019art nouveau belge.","performers":"L\u2019exposition \u00ab Jean Delhaye. Architecte et d\u00e9fenseur de l'\u0153uvre de Horta \u00bb a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ue par les services culture de la Commune de Ganshoren, avec le soutien d\u2019urban.brussels et en collaboration avec ARCHistory et la famille Delhaye.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ganshoren.be\/agenda\/exposition-jean-delhaye\/","email":"culture.francaise@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 05 39","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 05 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005342"},"sp":{"name":"Expo Jean Delhaye. Architecte et d\u00e9fenseur de l'oeuvre de Horta","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ganshoren.be\/agenda\/exposition-jean-delhaye\/","email":"culture.francaise@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 05 39","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 05 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005342"},"nl":{"name":"Jean Delhaye. Architect en verdediger van het werk van Horta","shortdescr":"Het Atelier Brunswyck\/Wathelet in Ganshoren presenteert de boeiende wereld van de modernistische architect Jean Delhaye (1908-1993).","longdescr":"In het kader van zijn inspanningen om de modernistische architectuur in Brussel te promoten, stelt het Atelier Brunswyck\/Wathelet de boeiende wereld tentoon van architect Jean Delhaye (1908-1993). Delhaye werkt vanaf 1934 in het bureau van Victor Horta en ontwikkelt simultaan zijn eigen praktijk. Hij specialiseert zich in de bouw van moderne flats in een Art Deco-stijl die hij van zijn meester erft. Hij woont in Ganshoren, een gemeente die op dat moment in volle ontwikkeling is, waar hij zeven woningen en appartementsgebouwen bouwt. Zijn onvoorwaardelijke bewondering voor Horta brengt hem ertoe zijn leven te wijden aan het behoud van diens werk. Delhaye speelt zo een sleutelrol in de internationale erkenning van de Belgische Art Nouveau.\n","performers":"De tentoonstelling \u201cJean Delhaye. Architect en verdediger van het werk van Horta\u201d is ontworpen door de culturele diensten van de gemeente Ganshoren, met de steun van urban.brussels en in samenwerking met ARCHistory en de familie Delhaye.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.ganshoren.be\/nl\/agenda\/expo-jean-delhaye\/","email":"nederlandse.cultuur@ganshoren.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 464 95 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 464 95 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005342"}},"place":{"id":50001344,"translations":{"de":{"name":"ATELIER BRUNSWYCK\/WATHELET","address_street_name":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1083","address_city":"Ganshoren","address_line1":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_line2":"1083 Ganshoren","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"ATELIER BRUNSWYCK\/WATHELET","address_street_name":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1083","address_city":"Ganshoren","address_line1":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_line2":"1083 Ganshoren","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"ATELIER BRUNSWYCK\/WATHELET","address_street_name":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1083","address_city":"Ganshoren","address_line1":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_line2":"1083 Ganshoren","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"ATELIER BRUNSWYCK\/WATHELET","address_street_name":"Avenue de Villegas 31","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1083","address_city":"Ganshoren","