dmarks and hidden gems nestled along the lesser-known paths. Get immersed in the rich history and culture of this cosmopolitan city as you experience Brussels in a delightfully engaging way. Let yourself be amazed by the lesser beaten tracks winding through Brussels and its lively neighborhoods. \nHalf-way we'll make a pit stop at a cozy caf\u00e9, offering the perfect opportunity to connect with fellow travelers and savor the local ambiance. \nJoin us for an unforgettable Brussels experience on two wheels! Discover our availability on our website. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/bike-tours-brussels","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005784"},"it":{"name":"Guided Bike Tour 'Brussels highlights & hidden gems'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/tours-velo-publiques","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005784"},"cn":{"name":"Guided Bike Tour 'Brussels highlights & hidden gems'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/tours-velo-publiques","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005784"},"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e \u00e0 v\u00e9lo 'Bruxelles, les incontournables et insolites'","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles \u00e0 v\u00e9lo lors de notre visite guid\u00e9e 'les incontournables et insolites de Bruxelles'. ","longdescr":"Explorez Bruxelles \u00e0 v\u00e9lo. Une aventure captivante de 3,5 heures pendant laquelle vous plongez au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles en compagnie de nos guides locaux passionn\u00e9s. Laissez-vous guider \u00e0 travers les joyaux cach\u00e9s, les sites embl\u00e9matiques de la ville et immergez-vous dans son histoire fascinante. \nD\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles de mani\u00e8re ludique et immersive, en d\u00e9nichant des tr\u00e9sors m\u00e9connus et en explorant ses quartiers dynamiques. \nA mi-chemin, une pause en pr\u00e9vue dans un caf\u00e9 sympa. Le moment de mieux connaitre les autres voyageurs et de profiter de l'atmosph\u00e8re locale. \nR\u00e9servez d\u00e8s maintenant votre place pour une aventure bruxelloise inoubliable \u00e0 v\u00e9lo ! D\u00e9couvrez nos disponibilit\u00e9s sur notre site web. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/tours-velo-publiques","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005784"},"sp":{"name":"Guided Bike Tour 'Brussels highlights & hidden gems'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/tours-velo-publiques","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005784"},"nl":{"name":"Gegidste fietstocht 'Highlights & minder betreden paden van Brussel'","shortdescr":"Ontdek Brussel langs de highlights en minder betreden paden met de fiets!","longdescr":"Beleef Brussel tijdens een onvergetelijke fietstour van 3,5 uur, waarbij onze lokale gidsen zowel de iconische als verborgen bezienswaardigheden onthullen. \nDuik in de rijke geschiedenis en cultuur van deze kosmopolitische stad en ontdek Brussel op een leuke en verrijkende manier. Laat je verrassen door de minder betreden paden van Brussel en haar diverse bruisende wijken. Onderweg pauzeren we in een gezellige caf\u00e9, ontmoet je andere reizigers en geniet je van de lokale sfeer. \nBoek nu je plek voor een 