r":"Despised after the industrial decline that left it battered, Molenbeek has developed some of the most picturesque Art Nouveau and Art Deco buildings in the world. ","longdescr":"A neglected district, scorned after the industrial decline that left it battered, Molenbeek has developed some of the most picturesque Art Nouveau and Art Deco buildings. The importance of the Saint Jean-Baptiste church is well established. But which among these multiple-apartment buildings, bourgeois or working-class single-family homes and social housing estates of the interwar period has been able to preserve the stylistic purity of the Art Deco and Modernist spirit? This is what we'll be looking at during our visit to this Brussels commune.\n\nAvailable languages: FR\/EN\/NL\/ESP\/POR\/ITA\/DEU","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/art-nouveau-art-deco","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005253"},"it":{"name":"Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Molenbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/art-nouveau-art-deco","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005253"},"cn":{"name":"Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Molenbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/art-nouveau-art-deco","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005253"},"fr":{"name":"Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Molenbeek","shortdescr":"M\u00e9pris\u00e9 apr\u00e8s le d\u00e9clin industriel qui l'a laiss\u00e9 meurtri, Molenbeek a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 en quelques endroits des r\u00e9alisations Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co des plus pittoresques. ","longdescr":"Quartier d\u00e9laiss\u00e9, m\u00e9pris\u00e9 apr\u00e8s le d\u00e9clin industriel qui l'a laiss\u00e9 meurtri, Molenbeek a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 en quelques endroits des r\u00e9alisations Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co des plus pittoresques. L'importance de l'\u00e9glise Saint Jean-Baptiste n'est plus \u00e0 d\u00e9montrer. Mais qui parmi ces immeubles \u00e0 appartements multiples, ces maisons uni-familiales bourgeoises ou ouvri\u00e8res de l'entre-deux-guerres et ces cit\u00e9s sociales a pu pr\u00e9server une puret\u00e9 de style de l'esprit Art D\u00e9co et  Moderniste? C\u2019est ce que nous aborderons lors de la visite de cette commune bruxelloise.\n\nLangues possibles: FR\/EN\/NL\/ESP\/POR\/ITA\/DEU","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/art-nouveau-art-deco","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005253"},"sp":{"name":"Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Molenbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/art-nouveau-art-deco","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005253"},"nl":{"name":"Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Molenbeek","shortdescr":"Molenbeek, verwaarloosd na het industri\u00eble verval dat het gehavend achterliet, heeft enkele van de meest pittoreske Art Nouveau en Art Deco gebouwen ontwikkeld. ","longdescr":"Molenbeek, een verwaarloosde wijk na de industri\u00eble achteruitgang die het gehavend achterliet, heeft enkele van de meest pittoreske Art Nouveau en Art Deco gebouwen ter wereld. Het belang van de Sint-Jean-Baptistenkerk staat vast. Maar wie van deze flatgebouwen, burgerlijke of arbeiders eengezinswoningen uit het interbellum en sociale woon