es de quiz cons\u00e9cutives, dans un d\u00e9cor de plateau TV avec un v\u00e9ritable show son et lumi\u00e8re. La salle de Quiz Game est \u00e9quip\u00e9e de 4 pupitres pouvant accueillir des \u00e9quipes jusqu'\u00e0 3 participants ! Le jeu est disponible en Fran\u00e7ais et en Anglais. 60 minutes = 8 manches, chacune avec sa propre r\u00e8gle 150% FUN","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.1-Heure-de-Quiz-Game-150-FUN-pour-2-personnes.50006762","website":"http:\/\/www.spacefungame.com","email":"info@spacefungame.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 720 01 23","phone_booking":"+32 2 720 01 23","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006762"},"sp":{"name":"1 H Quiz Game 150% FUN : 2 persons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/es\/visitantes\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.1-H-Quiz-Game-150-FUN-2-persons.50006762","website":"http:\/\/www.spacefungame.com","email":"info@spacefungame.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 720 01 23","phone_booking":"+32 2 720 01 23","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006762"},"nl":{"name":"1 U Quiz Game 150% FUN : 2 personen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/nl\/bezoekers\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.1-U-Quiz-Game-150-FUN-2-personen.50006762","website":"http:\/\/www.spacefungame.com","email":"info@spacefungame.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 720 01 23","phone_booking":"+32 2 720 01 23","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006762"}},"place":{"id":267946,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Space Fun Games","address_street_name":"Galerie Carrefour Shopping Saint Michel","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@spacefungame.com","website":"http:\/\/www.spacefungame.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 720 01 23","pho