event-detail.5700007360"},"pt":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007360"},"en":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007360"},"it":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007360"},"cn":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007360"},"fr":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":"Histoires pour r\u00eaver l'\u00e9galit\u00e9 \u00e0 partir de 7 ans\n\nM\u00e9lancolie, raconte des r\u00e9cits qui d\u00e9stabilisent les id\u00e9es pr\u00e9con\u00e7ues sur les hommes et les femmes, d\u00e9cloisonnent les genres, et nous aident surtout \u00e0 accepter nos parts f\u00e9minines et masculines a\ufb01n de nous rendre plus entiers. ","longdescr":"Une fois par mois depuis la naissance d\u2019Aurore, Marie et Ren\u00e9 offrent dans leur bar un coup \u00e0 boire en \u00e9change d\u2019une histoire. Ils esp\u00e8rent qu\u2019un jour quelqu\u2019un racontera trois mensonges qui soient \u00e9galement \u2026 trois v\u00e9rit\u00e9s ! Aurore sent qu\u2019on lui cache quelque chose d\u2019important. Que son destin est myst\u00e9rieusement li\u00e9 \u00e0 un \u00e9trange chaudron d\u2019or qui se tient dans la chemin\u00e9e. Mais quel est donc ce secret qui ronge ses parents ?Pourquoi le fait d\u2019\u00eatre n\u00e9e \ufb01lle les angoisse tellement ?\n\n\u2026 Et puis il y a ce chasseur ; un client du bistrot bien perturbant, qui clame constamment face \u00e0 l\u2019assembl\u00e9e qu\u2019une femme n\u2019est pas l\u2019\u00e9gale d\u2019un homme. Aurore et ses parents tenteront de lui prouver le contraire. Sans succ\u00e8s. Jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce que la nature \u2013 sa nature \u2013en d\u00e9cide autrement pour lui \u2026 sera-t\u2019il \ufb01nalement la clef de l\u2019\u00e9nigme qui l\u00e8vera la mal\u00e9diction du chaudron ? \u2026","performers":"M\u00e9lancolie Motte (conteuse)Hispaniques","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007360"},"sp":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 69 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 69 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007360"},"nl":{"name":"Et toi tu M\u00eame?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatredelaparole.be\/produit\/et-toi-tu-meme\/","email":"info@theatredelaparole.be","phone_co