where accessibility is at the core of artistic creation. This interactive session, organised by ARTIFESTO ASBL is part of the THEAvios Erasmus+ pilot workshop, exploring innovative ways to make theater accessible to all.\n\nWhat is TheaVios?\nTHEAvios is a European project focused on training and educating theater professionals\u2014including actors, directors, producers, and technicians\u2014so they can better welcome and collaborate with actors with visual impairments. Through the development and testing of innovative tools, we aim to foster seamless cooperation and create a more inclusive and accessible professional theater environment.\n\nWhat to Expect?\n- Brief presentation on the project's progress, findings, and results\n- Interactive activities with actors (audience participation is optional)\n-  Pilot performance showcasing our research\n-  Discussion & feedback session\n\n- Participation is free, but registration is required!\n- Register here: https:\/\/forms.gle\/AodNDuUU6413MKPJA\n\nFor more about TheaVios: Theavios.eu\nWe look forward to seeing you there! ","performers":"Theavios Project Team","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/Theavios.eu","email":"info@artifesto.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007407"},"it":{"name":"Support Inclusive Theater \u2013 Join the Open Session of the THEAvios Pilot Workshop!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/Theavios.eu","email":"info@artifesto.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007407"},"cn":{"name":"Support Inclusive Theater \u2013 Join the Open Session of the THEAvios Pilot Workshop!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/Theavios.eu","email":"info@artifesto.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"