en Mandingo muziek, rock en improvisatie voor Sina Kienou.\n","longdescr":"Their meeting in 2019 seals the joy of great unions. They met in 2019 in Burkina Faso at the\nBurkina Faso at the Festival Salon de Musique. From the Sahel, Sina Kienou dreamt of flamenco and gypsy music.\nSoledad Kalza looked to music from the East for the southern roots that would keep her there.\nThe virtuoso guitar of griot Sina Kienou delicately marries the voice of singer and poet Soledad Kalza, who moves from\nfrom song to slam, seeking in the sound of words the union of meaning and sound.\n","performers":"Soledad Kalza & Sina Kienou","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007497"},"it":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou duo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007497"},"cn":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou duo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007497"},"fr":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou duo","shortdescr":"Soledad Kalza & Sina Kienou est un duo riche des racines de leurs peuples et respectivement ancr\u00e9s dans des traditions fortes comme la chanson fran\u00e7aise \u00e0 texte, la protest song et le jazz pour la premi\u00e8re et la musique mandingue, le rock et l\u2019improvisation pour le second. ","longdescr":"leur rencontre en 2019 scelle la joie des grandes unions. Iels se sont rencontr\u00e9.e.s en 2019 au\nBurkina Faso lors du Festival Salon de Musique. Depuis le Sahel, Sina Kienou r\u00eavait au flamenco et aux musiques tziganes.\nSoledad Kalza cherchait dans les musiques venues de l\u2019Est la part du Sud qui l\u2019 y enracinait.\nLa guitare virtuose du griot Sina Kienou \u00e9pouse avec d\u00e9licatesse la voix de la chanteuse et po\u00e9tesse Soledad Kalza qui passe du\nchant au slam en cherchant dans la sonorit\u00e9 des mots l\u2019union du sens et du son.\n","performers":"Soledad Kalza & Sina Kienou ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007497"},"sp":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou duo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007497"},"nl":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou duo","shortdescr":"Soledad Kalza & Sina Kienou are a duo rich in the roots of their peoples and respectively anchored in strong traditions\nFrench chanson, protest song and jazz for Soledad Kalza, and Mandingo music, rock and improvisation for Sina Kienou.","longdescr":"Hun ontmoeting in 2019 bezegelt de vreugde van grote verbondenheid. Ze ontmoetten elkaar in 2019 in Burkina Faso bij de\nBurkina Faso op het Festival Salon de Musique. Vanuit de Sahel droomde Sina Kienou van flamenco en zigeunermuziek.\nSoledad Kalza keek naar muziek uit het Oosten voor de zuidelijke wortels die haar daar zouden houden.\nDe virtuoze gitaar van griot Sina Kienou versmelt op subtiele wijze met de stem van zangeres en dichteres Soledad Kalza, die van lied naar slam beweegt, op zoek naar haar wortels in het zuiden.\nvan lied naar slam, op zoek naar de vereniging van betekenis en geluid in de klank van woorden.\n","performers":"\nSoledad Kalza & Sina Kienou\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007497"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events prese