 transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"},"en":{"name":"Avec Dewin, l'\u00e9l\u00e9gante transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"},"it":{"name":"Avec Dewin, l'\u00e9l\u00e9gante transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"},"cn":{"name":"Avec Dewin, l'\u00e9l\u00e9gante transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"},"fr":{"name":"Avec Dewin, l'\u00e9l\u00e9gante transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Dans la tr\u00e8s chic avenue Moli\u00e8re, l'architecte Jean-Baptiste Dewin nous a offert quelques-unes de nos plus belles fa\u00e7ades Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co, assurant ainsi avec sobri\u00e9t\u00e9 et \u00e9l\u00e9gance la transition entre ces deux styles.\n \nPlace Brugmann, c\u2019est sa sp\u00e9cialisation comme b\u00e2tisseur d\u2019h\u00f4pitaux que nous d\u00e9couvrirons avec les deux cliniques qu\u2019il y a construites, abordant ainsi une grande page de l\u2019histoire de la m\u00e9decine, avec la guerre de 14-18, Antoine et Marie Depage, Edith Cavell et la Reine Elisabeth.\n \nCette visite est organis\u00e9e dans le cadre du BANAD 2025.\n\nD\u00e9part : devant l'\u00e9glise de la place Brugmann","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"},"sp":{"name":"Avec Dewin, l'\u00e9l\u00e9gante transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"},"nl":{"name":"Avec Dewin, l'\u00e9l\u00e9gante transition de l'Art nouveau \u00e0 l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/","email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005934"}},"place":{"id":276507,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"High-quality florists, a bookshop with a wide range of choices, fine pastry shops, art galleries and gourmet stops... Place Georges Brugmann really does have a lot going for it. It's located in one of the most affluent districts of Brussels, in the extension of the beautiful and tree-lined avenue Louis Lepoutre. The square lives off the somewhat nonchalant dynamism that has often characterised this wealthy neighbourhood. Moreover, the area is a wonderful spot to see marvellous architectural experiments from between the end of the century and the 1930s. You'll see edifices ranging from private mansions to chic and functional buildings.   ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Fleuristes de belle qualit\u00e9, librairie aux choix assur\u00e9s, p\u00e2tisseries fines, galeries d\u2019art et haltes gourmandes\u2026 La place Georges Brugmann a vraiment de tr\u00e8s beaux atouts. D\u2019une part, elle est situ\u00e9e dans un des quartiers les plus cossus de Bruxelles dans le prolongement de la tr\u00e8s belle et arbor\u00e9e avenue Louis Lepoutre. D\u2019autre part, elle vit de ce dynamisme un peu nonchalant qui a souvent caract\u00e9ris\u00e9 ce quartier sans difficult\u00e9 financi\u00e8re apparente. C\u2019est aussi un tr\u00e8s bel endroit pour ces essais architecturaux entre la fin de si\u00e8cle et les ann\u00e9es trente allant d\u2019h\u00f4tels particuliers aux immeubles chics et fonctionnels.   ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Place Brugmann","address_street_name":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place Georges Brugmann","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Brugmannplein ","address_street_name":"Georges Brugmannplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Georges Brugmannplein","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Het Georges Brugmannplein staat garant voor kwaliteit. Of het nu om de bloemisten gaat of om de boekhandels, patisserie\u00ebn, kunstgalerijen of restaurants. Dit plein ligt dan ook in een van de meest welstellende wijken van Brussel. Het geeft uit op de prachtige Louis Lepoutrelaan. Ondanks de rijkdom die hier heerst, hangt er een intrigerende, nonchalante dynamiek in deze wijk. Alleen al de schitterende architectuur uit de belle \u00e9poque en uit de jaren \u201930 van de vorige eeuw zijn een omweg waard.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[6],"translations":{"de":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"pt":[null],"en":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"it":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Chatelain\/Bailli"],"sp":["Ch\u00e2telain\/Bailli"],"nl":["Kasteleinswijk\/Baljuw"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":36507,"location":{"lat":50.81675031,"lon":4.35374961},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-07-06T04:20:04+02:00","published_at":"2021-05-04T15:27:52+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":1491,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Brussels Chatterguides","address_street_name":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre, 3","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"Brussels Chatterguides : an irresistible invitation to discover and love Brussels!\nAccompanied by a Chatterguide, discover the many facets of Brussels: from the Grand Place to Art Nouveau neighborhoods, from chocolate to Belgian beers, from Bruegel to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u00ab belgitude \u00bb).\n\n-  In Brussels for the first time?  in a few hours, by bus or on foot, we will show you the highlights and let you sample the spirit of the town\n- You believe you already know the city? Let us surprise you with our thematic tours and  neighborhoods\u2019 discovery (more than a hundred!)\n- Organizing a private or business trip or event? Your groups will love our guided tours, tastings and walking dinners ... and you too because we aim to exceed your expectations and take care of everything !\nSince 1983: talkative, experienced and enthusiastic.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Chatterguides","address_street_name":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre, 3","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"Brussels Chatterguides : an irresistible invitation to discover and love Brussels!\nAccompanied by a Chatterguide, discover the many facets of Brussels: from the Grand Place to Art Nouveau neighborhoods, from chocolate to Belgian beers, from Bruegel to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u0