sites guid\u00e9es dans des expositions, des mus\u00e9es et des ateliers d\u2019artistes. Ils jettent un coup d\u2019\u0153il dans les coulisses d\u2019une surprenante Bruxelles et partent \u00e0 la recherche de r\u00e9cits fascinants d\u2019hier, d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui et de demain ! Korei soul\u00e8ve le voile sur l\u2019architecture, la croissance urbaine, les mentalit\u00e9s, l\u2019art et le design. Langues : Fran\u00e7ais-N\u00e9erlandais- Anglais- Allemand\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Korei","address_street_name":"Place du Samedi ","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Samedi , 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Korei Guided Tours","address_street_name":"Zaterdagplein ","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@korei.be","website":"http:\/\/www.korei.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 380 22 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zaterdagplein , 6","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Korei Guided Tours\u2026Brussel achter de schermen! Korei Guided Tours organiseert al meer dan 25 jaar wandelingen, interieurbezoeken, lezingen en rondleidingen in tentoonstellingen, musea en artiestenateliers. Ze kijken achter de coulissen van verrassend Brussel en gaan op zoek naar boeiende verhalen van vandaag, morgen en gisteren! Met Korei ontdek je architectuur, stedelijke ontwikkelingen, denkgewoontes, kunst en design.                                               \nTalen: Nederlands-Frans-Engels-Duits \n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"