l":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000053"},"cn":{"name":"La Soeur de J\u00e9sus Christ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.La-Soeur-de-Jesus-Christ.5700000053","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000053"},"fr":{"name":"La Soeur de J\u00e9sus Christ","shortdescr":"Western moderne.","longdescr":"Maria est cette jeune fille qui s\u2019empare du pistolet dans le buffet de la cuisine, quitte la maison, et se rend chez Angelo le jeune homme qui lui a fait violence la veille. Tout le village assiste \u00e0 cette marche que rien ni personne ne pourra arr\u00eater. L\u2019heure du jugement est venue et Maria ne fait confiance ni \u00e0 la justice des hommes ni \u00e0 celle de Dieu.\n\u00c9poustouflant, F\u00e9lix Vannoorenberghe, le personnage qui raconte l\u2019histoire, fait vivre tout un village italien emport\u00e9 dans la r\u00e9volte de cette jeune fille qui soudain refuse de porter la croix du patriarcat et embarque un monde dans sa marche in\u00e9luctable. Ou la Passion selon Saint Georges Lini, qui signe une mise en sc\u00e8ne prodigieuse. Une pi\u00e8ce sur les violences patriarcales, sur la puissance collective des repr\u00e9sentations et des jugements, et sur la force de la volont\u00e9.","performers":"De Oscar de Summa\nTraduction Federica Martucci avec le soutien de la Maison Antoine Vitez, traduction laur\u00e9ate de l\u2019ARTCENA\nMise en sc\u00e8ne Georges Lini\nAvec F\u00e9lix Vannoorenberghe\nMusicienne et compositrice Florence Sauveur\nCollaboration dramaturgique Nargis Benamor\nCr\u00e9ation vid\u00e9o S\u00e9bastien Fernandez\nSc\u00e9nographie et costumes Charly Kleinermann et Thibaut De Coster","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.La-Soeur-de-Jesus-Christ.5700000053","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000053"},"sp":{"name":"La Soeur de J\u00e9sus Christ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/es\/visitantes\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.La-Soeur-de-Jesus-Christ.5700000053","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000053"},"nl":{"name":"La Soeur de J\u00e9sus Christ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/nl\/bezoekers\/agenda\/event-detail\/book-tickets.La-Soeur-de-Jesus-Christ.5700000053","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000053"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rodestraat","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rodestraat, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc du Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est : \n- Un des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs,\n- Un rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle,\n- 3 espaces bien distincts ( Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle),\n- Une salle de spectacle de 800 places,\n- Un gradin r\u00e9tractable de 162 places,\n- 200 activit\u00e9s par an,\n- 600 artistes par saison,\n- 50.000 spectateurs par an.\n\n-----\n\nHoraires Bureaux  > du lundi au vendredi : 9h00 > 12h00 \u2013 14h00 > 17h00\n\nR\u00e9servations > du mardi au vendredi : 11h00 > 18h00 et  1h avant les spectacles\n(ferm\u00e9 de mi-juillet \u00e0 mi-ao\u00fbt)\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Ukkel","address_street_name":"Rodestraat","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Rodestraat, 47","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":320,"location":{"lat":50.8010349,"lon":4.3423684},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2025-03-13T14:52:11+01:00","p