t House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"},"en":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Holvoet House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"This bourgeois house in the Art Deco style was built in 1928 by the architect Adolphe Deboodt for Mme Holvoet. Its red brick fa\u00e7ade is pierced by multiple windows with remarkable geometric stained glass. The interior has retained its precious wood panelling, its fireplaces and floors, as well as its magnificent carefully crafted stairwell.\n\nArch. Adolphe DEBOODT, 1928","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Holvoet House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Holvoet House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Maison Holvoet","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De style Art d\u00e9co, cette maison bourgeoise fut \u00e9difi\u00e9e en 1928 par l'architecte Adolphe Deboodt pour Mme Holvoet. Sa large fa\u00e7ade de briques rouges est perc\u00e9e de multiples fen\u00eatres aux vitraux g\u00e9om\u00e9triques remarquables. L'am\u00e9nagement int\u00e9rieur a su conserver ses lambris en bois pr\u00e9cieux, ses chemin\u00e9es et sols, ainsi que sa magnifique cage d'escalier et ses \u00e9clairages int\u00e9gr\u00e9s, travaill\u00e9s avec beaucoup de soins.\n\nArch. Adolphe DEBOODT, 1928","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Guided tour of the Holvoet House","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Woning Holvoet","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006354"}},"place":{"id":50002893,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison Holvoet","address_street_name":"Rue de la Source","address_street_number":"82","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue de la Source, 82","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison Holvoet","address_street_name":"Rue de la Source","address_street_number":"82","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"add