tager.co\/shop\/brussels\/events\/111504012\n- Hits only!\nFrom start to finish, enjoy the very best party music for an unforgettable night.\n\nRelive the greatest hits of the 2000s-2010s! Come dance, join us, bring friends, and dress to impress!\nA production by\nJust An Night, Expats in Brussels, Les Belges Jeunesses & Plein Publiek BXL\n\nThe venue\nPalais de la Dynastie \u2013 Plein Publiek BXL\nMont des Arts with a stunning spring terrace.\nDJ T G-Froy & guests will keep you dancing all night long!\nDoors open: 11:00 PM - 04:00 AM\nIndoor clubhouse & beautiful outdoor terrace \u2013 no matter the weather, we\u2019ve got you covered!\nTickets & reservations\nPresales + Garanty Pass \u2192 Skip the Line!\nGet your tickets here: Ticket link\nTable booking: info@justanight.net\nTickets also available at the door.\nMore than just a night out!\nGet ready for an unforgettable night at the iconic Plein Publiek BXL.\n\nAddress: Palais de la Dynastie, Mont des Arts (Kunstberg) 5, 1000 Brussels.\nCome party with us! Share the event, invite your friends, and let\u2019s celebrate together!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007713"},"it":{"name":"Mont des Arts Party - Back to 2000 -2010","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007713"},"cn":{"name":"Mont des Arts Party - Back to 2000 -2010","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007713"},"fr":{"name":"Mont des Arts Party - Back to 2000 -2010","shortdescr":"Ce samedi 22 mars 2025 \u2013 La meilleure soir\u00e9e de Bruxelles !\nMont des Arts Party \u2013 Back 2 Music 2000-2010 @ Plein Publiek BXL","longdescr":"Ce samedi 22 mars 2025 \u2013 La meilleure soir\u00e9e de Bruxelles !\nMont des Arts Party \u2013 Back 2 Music 2000-2010 @ Plein Publiek BXL\n\u00c9v\u00e9nement Facebook : Lien ici https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/\nSkip the Line + Garanty Pass : R\u00e9servez vos billets https:\/\/pleinpubliek.stager.co\/shop\/brussels\/events\/111504012\n- Hits only !\nDe d\u00e9but \u00e0 la fin, profitez uniquement des meilleurs sons pour une soir\u00e9e inoubliable.\n\nRevivez les plus grands hits des ann\u00e9es 2000-2010 ! Venez danser, rejoignez-nous, invitez vos amis et sortez votre plus belle tenue !\nUne production de\nJust An Night, Expats in Brussels, Les Belges Jeunesses & Plein Publiek BXL\n\nLe lieu\nLe Palais de la Dynastie \u2013 Plein Publiek BXL\nMont des Arts avec une magnifique terrasse printani\u00e8re.\nDJ T G-Froy & invit\u00e9s vous feront danser toute la nuit !\nOuverture des portes : 23h00 - 04h00\nClubhouse int\u00e9rieur & superbe terrasse ext\u00e9rieure \u2013 quel que soit le temps, tout est pr\u00e9vu !\nBillets & r\u00e9servations\nPr\u00e9ventes + Garanty Pass \u2192 Skip the Line !\nR\u00e9servez vos billets ici : Lien de r\u00e9servation\nR\u00e9servation de table : info@justanight.net\nBillets \u00e9galement disponibles \u00e0 l\u2019entr\u00e9e.\nBien plus qu\u2019une simple soir\u00e9e !\nPr\u00e9parez-vous pour une nuit inoubliable dans l\u2019embl\u00e9matique Plein Publiek BXL.\n\nAdresse : Palais de la Dynastie, Mont des Arts (Kunstberg) 5, 1000 Bruxelles.","performers":"ExpatsInBrussels","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007713"},"sp":{"name":"Mont des Arts Party - Back to 2000 -2010","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007713"},"nl":{"name":"Mont des Arts Party - Back to 2000 -2010","shortdescr":"Deze zaterdag 22 maart 2025 \u2013 Het beste feest in Brussel!\nMont des Arts Party \u2013 Back 2 Music 2000-2010 @ Plein Publiek BXL","longdescr":"Deze zaterdag 22 maart 2025 \u2013 Het beste feest in Brussel!\nMont des Arts Party \u2013 Back 2 Music 2000-2010 @ Plein Publiek BXL\nFacebook-evenement: Link hier https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/506622112140583\/\nSkip the Line + Garanty Pass: Reserveer je tickets https:\/\/pleinpubliek.stager.co\/shop\/brussels\/events\/111504012\n- Alleen hits!\nVan begin tot eind, geniet van de allerbeste feestmuziek voor een onvergetelijke avond.\n\nHerbeleef de grootste hits van de jaren 2000-2010! Kom dansen, sluit je bij ons aan, nodig vrienden uit en kleed je om indruk te maken!\nEen productie van\nJust An Night, Expats in Brussels, Les Belges Jeunesses & Plein Publiek BXL\n\nDe locatie\nHet Paleis van de Dynastie \u2013 Plein Publiek BXL\nMont des Arts met een prachtig lenteterras.\nDJ T G-Froy & gasten laten je de hele nacht dansen!\nDeuren open: 23:00 - 04:00\nIndoor clubhouse & prachtig buitenterras \u2013 ongeacht het weer, alles is voorzien!\nTickets & reserveringen\nVoorverkoop + Garanty Pass \u2192 Skip the Line!\nReserveer je tickets hier: Ticketlink\nTafelreservering: info@justanight.net\nTickets ook beschikbaar aan de deur.\nVeel meer dan een gewone avond uit!\nMaak je klaar voor een onvergetelijke nacht in het iconi