Art Deco","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The pre war Brussels pubs offer a wide variety of atmospheres and some of them have kept their Art Nouveau or Art Deco decoration.\nThe stained glass windows, elegant curved woodwork, precious fabrics, mirrors and shining counters are still witnesses of the Belle Epoque, the Roaring Twenties & Jazzy Thirties. They also tell about the evolution of the trends and tastes: from the well-lit, big & noisy brasseries of the turn of the century to the more discreet, cosy and intimate bars of the interwar period.\nThis visit is being organised as part of BANAD 2025.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/en\/for-individuals\/16--2158--banad-2025-taverns-that-tell-of-the-splendour-of-art-nouveau-and-art-deco","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006797"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Taverns that tell of the splendour of Art Nouveau and Art Deco","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/16--2158--quand-les-estaminets-racontent-l-art-nouveau-et-l-art-deco","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006797"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Taverns that tell of the splendour of Art Nouveau and Art Deco","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/16--2158--quand-les-estaminets-racontent-l-art-nouveau-et-l-art-deco","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006797"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Quand les estaminets racontent l'Art nouveau et l'Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Les estaminets bruxellois offrent des atmosph\u00e8res tr\u00e8s vari\u00e9es. Certains d'entre eux ont conserv\u00e9 leur d\u00e9cor Art nouveau ou Art D\u00e9co.\n\nVitraux, boiseries pr\u00e9cieuses aux courbes \u00e9l\u00e9gantes et comptoirs rutilants se souviennent de la Belle \u00c9poque, des ann\u00e9es folles et jazzy. Ils t\u00e9moignent de l'\u00e9volution des go\u00fbts : grands caf\u00e9s lumineux, ouverts, anim\u00e9s au d\u00e9but du si\u00e8cle, plus secrets, intimistes, feutr\u00e9s dans l'entre-deux guerres.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/16--2158--quand-les-estaminets-racontent-l-art-nouveau-et-l-art-deco","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006797"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Taverns that tell of the splendour of Art Nouveau and Art Deco","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/fr\/visites-pour-individuels\/16--2158--quand-les-estaminets-racontent-l-art-nouveau-et-l-art-deco","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006797"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Het verhaal van de Brusselse art-nouveau en art-decocaf\u00e9s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Geen Brusselse kroeg of ze heeft haar eigen sfeer\u2026 Ze zijn nog talrijk, de kroegen die hun art nouveau of art deco interieur bewaard hebben.\n\nGlasramen, kostbare houtbekleding met elegante welvingen, rijke stoffen, spiegels, glimmende tapkasten. De Belle Epoque is nooit ver weg noch de dolle, wervelende jaren. De hele evolutie van de smaak komt tot leven: grote, heldere, open caf\u00e9s vol leven uit de ontluikende 20ste eeuw. En andere, intimistisch, in zichzelf gekeerd, gedempt, uit het interbellum.\n\nDit bezoek wordt georganiseerd in het kader van BANAD 2025.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be\/nl\/individuele-deelnemers\/16--2158--banad-2025-een-verhaal-van-art-nouveau-en-art-deco-in-kroegen","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006797"}},"place":{"id":259714,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Devant la Bourse ","address_street_name":"Place de la Bourse","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Bourse","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Devant la Bourse ","address_street_name":"Place de la Bourse","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Bourse","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"In front of the Stock Exchange ","address_street_name":"Place de la Bourse","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place de la Bourse","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Devant la Bourse ","address_street_name":"Place de la Bourse","address_street_number":