,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"pt":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"en":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":"Basketball academy: introduction to basketball and psychomotor skills for children from 5 to 12 years old.  Classes take place on Saturday mornings in the Omnisport Hall of the CERIA in Anderlecht.","longdescr":"The Monster Basket association wants to offer young people the opportunity to play a sport (out of competition) and to be part of a group, in a different way than at school. We want to offer them a sporting experience in a communal and family atmosphere. \nWe offer young people a safe and modern place to practice various activities (basketball basics, psychomotor skills, etc.).","performers":"Ludovic Hazard (junior basketball coach), Edna Carole Gahamanyi Senga (physiotherapist), Mathieu Kasiers (manager)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"it":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"cn":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"fr":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":"Acad\u00e9mie de basket: initiation basket et psychomotricit\u00e9 pour enfants de 5 \u00e0 12 ans.  Les cours ont lieu les samedis matins dans le Hall Omnisport du CERIA \u00e0 Anderlecht.","longdescr":"L\u2019association Monster Basket a la volont\u00e9 d\u2019offrir aux jeunes, \u00e0 travers le basket, la possibilit\u00e9 de pratiquer un sport (hors comp\u00e9tition) et de faire partie d\u2019un groupe, d\u2019une mani\u00e8re diff\u00e9rente qu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cole. Nous souhaitons leur offrir une exp\u00e9rience sportive dans un esprit collectif et familial.\nNous offrons aux jeunes un endroit s\u00e9curis\u00e9 et moderne afin d\u2019y pratiquer des exercices vari\u00e9s (fondamentaux, psychomotricit\u00e9, \u2026).","performers":"Ludovic Hazard (basketbalcoach jongeren), Edna Carole Gahamanyi Senga (kin\u00e9sith\u00e9rapeute), Mathieu Kasiers (beheerder)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"sp":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.monsterbasket.be","email":"mathieu@monsterbasket.be","phone_contact":"+32 472 48 62 17","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007568"},"nl":{"name":"Monster Basket","shortdescr":"Basketbal academie: initiatie basketbal en psychomotorische vaardigheden voor kinderen van 5 tot 12 jaar. De lessen vinden plaats op zaterdagochtend in de CERIA Omnisport Hall in Anderlecht.","longdescr":"De vereniging Monster Basket wil jongeren via basketbal de mogelijkheid bieden om (buiten competitie) een sport te beoefenen en deel uit te maken van een groep, op een andere manier dan op