,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"},"en":{"name":"Brazilian Trio","shortdescr":" A rhythmic immersion in the soul of Brazilian music\nThe Brazilian Trio, made up of Fl\u00e1vio Maciel de Souza (vocals and guitar), Herv\u00e9 Caparros (vocals and guitar) and Renato Martins(caj\u00f3n), invites you to enjoy a vibrant musical experience, with energy and rhythm at the heart of every note.\n","longdescr":"With passion and authenticity, this trio explores the richness of samba, bossa nova and MPB (Popular Brazilian Music), styles that have become increasingly popular in Brazil.\n(Brazilian Popular Music), styles where intoxicating beats and sunny melodies meet. Brazilian rhythms\nBrazilian rhythms, the driving force behind this music, infuse it with irresistible vitality, while the guitars harmonise to create warm, sunny soundscapes. \nWith each performance, the Brazilian Trio transports the audience into a world where the rhythmic rhyth\n\n","performers":"Renato Martins - percussion, Flavio de Souza - Voix et guitare,  Herv\u00e9 Caparros - guitare","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"},"it":{"name":"Brazilian Trio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"},"cn":{"name":"Brazilian Trio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"},"fr":{"name":"Brazilian Trio","shortdescr":"  Une immersion rythmique dans l'\u00e2me de la musique br\u00e9silienne\nLe Brazilian Trio, compos\u00e9 de Fl\u00e1vio Maciel de Souza (chant et guitare), Herv\u00e9 Caparros (chant et guitare) etRenato Martins(caj\u00f3n), vous invite \u00e0 vivre une exp\u00e9rience musicale vibrante, o\u00f9 l'\u00e9nergie et le rythme sont au c\u0153ur de chaque note.","longdescr":"Avec passion et authenticit\u00e9, ce trio explore les richesses de la samba, de la bossa nova et de la MPB (Musique Populaire Br\u00e9silienne), des styles o\u00f9 les pulsations enivrantes et les m\u00e9lodies ensoleill\u00e9es se r\u00e9pondent. Les rythmes br\u00e9siliens, v\u00e9ritable moteur de cette musique, insufflent une vitalit\u00e9 irr\u00e9sistible, tandis que les guitares s\u2019harmonisen pour cr\u00e9er des paysages sonores chaleureux et dynamiques.\n\u00c0 chaque performance, le Brazilian Trio transporte le public dans un univers o\u00f9 les rythmes cadenc\u00e9s r\u00e9veillent les corps et o\u00f9 l\u2019\u00e9nergie communicative de la musique br\u00e9silienne donne vie \u00e0 une exp\u00e9rience collective inoubliable.\nBrazilian Trio : une c\u00e9l\u00e9bration du rythme, de l\u2019\u00e9nergie et de l\u2019\u00e2me br\u00e9silienne.\n","performers":"Renato Martins - percussion, Flavio de Souza - Voix et guitare,  Herv\u00e9 Caparros - guitare","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"},"sp":{"name":"Brazilian Trio","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"},"nl":{"name":"Brazilian Trio","shortdescr":"Een ritmische onderdompeling in de ziel van de Braziliaanse muziek\nHet Braziliaanse Trio, bestaande uit Fl\u00e1vio Maciel de Souza (zang en gitaar), Herv\u00e9 Caparros (zang en gitaar) en Renato Martins (caj\u00f3n), nodigt u uit om te genieten van een levendige muzikale ervaring, met energie en ritme in het hart van elke noot.\nvan elke noot.","longdescr":"Met passie en authenticiteit verkent dit trio de rijkdom van samba, bossa nova en MPB (populaire Braziliaanse muziek), stijlen die steeds populairder zijn geworden in Brazili\u00eb.\n(Braziliaanse populaire muziek), stijlen waarin bedwelmende beats en zonnige melodie\u00ebn elkaar ontmoeten. Braziliaanse ritmes\nBraziliaanse ritmes, de drijvende kracht achter deze muziek, geven het een onweerstaanbare vitaliteit, terwijl de gitaren harmoni\u00ebren om warme, zonnige soundscapes te cre\u00ebren.\nom warme, dynamische klanklandschappen te cre\u00ebren.\nBij elk optreden neemt het Braziliaanse Trio het publiek mee naar een wereld waar de ritmische ritmes de lichamen wakker schudden en de aanstekelijke energie van Braziliaanse muziek zorgt voor een onvergetelijke collectieve ervaring.\nBrazilian Trio: een feest van Braziliaans ritme, energie en ziel.","performers":"Renato Martins - percussion, Flavio de Souza - Voix et guitare,  Herv\u00e9 Caparros - guitare","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007500"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","a