Bruxelles et le Pajottenland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Durant cette balade guid\u00e9e \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, vous parcourrez la vall\u00e9e de la Senne sur 21 km, pour d\u00e9couvrir la Senne \u00e9videmment, mais aussi deux de ses affluents, le Zuunbeek et le Vogelzangbeek, ainsi que le canal Charleroi-Bruxelles. Vous traversez des paysages o\u00f9 alternent prairies, champs, parcs, villes, villages et r\u00e9serves naturelles. Ces couloirs verts et bleus vous permettront de r\u00e9aliser de tr\u00e8s belles liaisons entre la ville et la campagne, sur les terres d\u2019Anderlecht, Sint-Pieters-Leeuw et Beersel.","performers":"Coordination Senne","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coordinationsenne.be\/mailer\/mailer_CoZ-CoS_wandelingen-promenades_2025\/emailbody_FR.htm","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007735"},"sp":{"name":"De vall\u00e9e en vall\u00e9e \u00e0 v\u00e9lo, entre Bruxelles et le Pajottenland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coordinationsenne.be\/mailer\/mailer_CoZ-CoS_wandelingen-promenades_2025\/emailbody_FR.htm","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007735"},"nl":{"name":"Van vallei naar vallei tussen Brussel en het Pajottenland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Tijdens deze begeleide fietstocht van 21km doorkruis je de Zennevallei, ontdek je twee zijrivieren - de Zuunbeek en de Vogelzangbeek - en fiets je langs het kanaal Charleroi-Brussel. In de glooiende landschappen wisselen weiden, velden, parken, steden, dorpen en natuurreservaten elkaar af. We ontdekken er de groene en blauwe corridors die stad en platteland met elkaar verbinden in Anderlecht, Sint-Pieters-Leeuw en Beersel.","performers":"Co\u00f6rdinatie Zenne","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.coordinatiezenne.be\/mailer\/mailer_CoZ-CoS_wandelingen-promenades_2025\/emailbody_NL.htm","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007735"}},"place":{"id":280451,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ecluse d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Ecluse d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Ecluse d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Ecluse d'Anderlecht","address_street_name":"croisement rue A. Dehem et quai de Veeweyde","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","a