lles","description_web":"Spirito Brussels, the temple of the night, located in Brussels, in an old anglican church.\r\n\r\nIn an innovative decor made of crystal and gold, SPIRITO BRUSSELS offers a huge dance floor in an incredible ambience. Tinted glass railings, mirrors and clean lines make the place\u2019s exceptional environment. Particular attention was paid to the lighting of the club, where the 'RGB lights' created a unique and mysterious atmosphere. Indeed, in a report by the edge channel 7, SPIRITO BRUSSELS has been ranked as one of the most beautiful clubs in the world.\r\n \r\nThe Club is open every Friday, Saturday and public holiday eve from 11p","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Spirito Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de Stassart","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.spiritobrussels.com\/","phone_contact":"+32 483 58 06 97","phone_booking":"+32 483 58 06 97","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Stassart, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Un locale cult nella capitale, tra le mura di un'antica chiesa anglicana: un ambiente mozzafiato!\r\nQuando: Venerd\u00ec \/ Sabato dalle 23:00 alle 06:00\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Spirito Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de Stassart","address_street_number":"18","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.spiritobrussels.com\/","phone_contact":"+32 483 58 06 97","phone_booking":"+32 483 58 06 97","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Stassart, 18","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Spirito Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de Stassart","address_st