ie-senecaut\/","email":"info@lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 332 40 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007236"},"it":{"name":"L'arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebrass.be\/event\/sophie-senecaut\/","email":"info@lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 332 40 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007236"},"cn":{"name":"L'arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebrass.be\/event\/sophie-senecaut\/","email":"info@lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 332 40 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007236"},"fr":{"name":"L'arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat","shortdescr":"Apr\u00e8s le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Balsamine, puis la Maison Po\u00e8me, c\u2019est au BRASS que \u201c L\u2019arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat\u201d va venir d\u00e9ployer sa proposition.\n\n\u25b6\ufe0e 16h CONTES ET JEUX \u00ab Raconter des salades \u00bb (\u00e2ge conseill\u00e9 : 7-12 ans)\n\u25b6\ufe0e 17h Initiation DANSE HIP HOP free style (tous publics)\n\u25b6\ufe0e 20h-22h PERFORMANCES \n\n\u2605 GRATUIT \u2605\nPas de r\u00e9servation n\u00e9cessaire","longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Balsamine, puis la Maison Po\u00e8me, c\u2019est au BRASS que \u201c L\u2019arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat\u201d va venir d\u00e9ployer sa proposition.\n\nLes moments de partage sont diff\u00e9rents \u00e0  chacun des arr\u00eats dans les lieux partenaires mais la tentative reste la m\u00eame : en d\u00e9bordant les modes et codes connus, c\u2019est celle d\u2019inventer sa propre route.\n\nSophie nous invite \u00e0 venir tourner autour de ses propositions et de celles de ses invit\u00e9\u00b7e\u00b7s pour une fin de journ\u00e9e qui m\u00ealera ateliers et performances.\n\n\u00ab Nous serons 6 : Sophie, Chems, Raquel, Antoinette, Per et Calvin. Ce qui nous importera de partager avec vous, c\u2019est peut \u00eatre l\u2019empreinte des choses que nous avons cru voir, ce avec quoi nous sommes venu\u00b7es (tant de choses\u2026 ). \u00bb\n\n \n\n\u25b6\ufe0e 16h CONTES ET JEUX \u00ab Raconter des salades \u00bb (\u00e2ge conseill\u00e9 : 7-12 ans)\n\n\u25b6\ufe0e 17h Initiation DANSE HIP HOP free style (tous publics)\n\n\u25b6\ufe0e 20h-22h PERFORMANCES \n\n_____________________\n\nSophie S\u00e9n\u00e9caut est connue pour son travail de com\u00e9dienne dans diff\u00e9rentes compagnies de th\u00e9\u00e2tre contemporain, mais ce n\u2019est pas de sa pratique d\u2019interpr\u00e8te dont il sera question ici. En effet, ces derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es, Sophie Senecaut a entam\u00e9 un autre travail, de fond, celui d\u2019une progressive translation. En dehors des assignations de la sc\u00e8ne et dans des lieux autrement propices \u00e0 l\u2019expression d\u2019une parole singuli\u00e8re.\n\n\u2605 GRATUIT \u2605\n\nPas de r\u00e9servation n\u00e9cessaire","performers":"Sophie S\u00e9n\u00e9caut ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebrass.be\/event\/sophie-senecaut\/","email":"info@lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 332 40 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007236"},"sp":{"name":"L'arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebrass.be\/event\/sophie-senecaut\/","email":"info@lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 332 40 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007236"},"nl":{"name":"L'arbre qui cachait la for\u00eat","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebrass.be\/event\/sophie-senecaut\/","email":"info@lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 332 40 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007236"}},"place":{"id":245910,"translations":{"de":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Das Brass ist das Kulturzentrum der Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinde Forest, das sich insbesondere f\u00fcr urbane Kunstformen und alternative Musikgenres interessiert. Dabei setzt das BRASS vor allem auf lokale, interkulturelle und k\u00fcnstlerische Initiativen. In diesem Sinne bringt sich das Brass regelm\u00e4\u00dfig bei verschiedenen Veranstaltungen ein: vom K\u00fcnstlerparcours \"Parcours d'Artistes\" \u00fcber das Kinderkunstfestival \"SuperVlieg \/ SuperMouche\" bis hin zu dem Musikfestival Forest Sounds Festival im Parc de Forest. Das ganze Jahr \u00fcber werden hier zudem Konzerte, Ausstellungen, Workshops, offene B\u00fchnen, Begegnungen und Performance-Abende organisiert. Hinzu kommen Ausstellungen und K\u00fcnstlerresidenzen in der Abbaye de Forest, dem zuk\u00fcnftigen Kulturpol der Gemeinde.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Brass is Vorst's cultural centre, showing a clear predilection for urban arts and the more alternative music scene. \r\nThe BRASS focuses on all inhabitants by capitalizing local energies and intercultural, artistic and civic initiatives in the districts of Forest and the south of Brussels. The center is involved in the organization of the Artists' Circuit, the SuperVlieg \/ SuperMouche Festival and the future music festival in Forest Park. Throughout the year, it offers concerts, shows, exhibitions, workshops, open scenes, citizen meetings, performances, as well as exhibitions and artists residencies in the Abbey of Forest, the district's future cultural center.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"LE BRASS EST LE CENTRE CULTUREL et LA MAISON DES CULTURES DE FOREST.\nLa plus grande partie de ses actions est men\u00e9e au coeur m\u00eame de l\u2019ancienne brasserie Wielemans-Ceuppens, dont les machines ont \u00e9t\u00e9 pr\u00e9serv\u00e9es et qui reste un v\u00e9ritable t\u00e9moin du patrimoine industriel du d\u00e9but du XXe si\u00e8cle.\nTout au long de l\u2019ann\u00e9e, du matin au soir, le BRASS propose des concerts, des spectacles, des expositions, des ateliers, des rencontres conviviales et citoyennes, des festivals th\u00e9matiques, une \u00e9cole des devoirs\u2026\nAu coeur de la diversit\u00e9 bruxelloise, il soutient la vitalit\u00e9 artistique et culturelle \u00e9mergente.\nAncr\u00e9 dans son quartier, le BRASS s\u2019adresse \u00e0 tou\u00b7te\u00b7s les habitant\u00b7e\u00b7s en capitalisant les \u00e9nergies locales et les initiatives interculturelles, artistiques et citoyennes des quartiers de Forest et du sud de Bruxelles.\nIl accorde une grande importance \u00e0 la participation des habitant\u00b7e\u00b7s dans son projet d\u2019action culturelle. \u00c0 ce titre, il s\u2019implique dans l\u2019organisation du festival Park Po\u00e9tik, du festival Forest Sounds et du Parcours 1190.\nLe Centre Culturel prend \u00e9galement part \u00e0 la programmation de la Fabr\u00ffk AB\u0178, qui se veut une pr\u00e9figuration de ce que sera le futur P\u00f4le Culturel de la Commune \u00e0 l\u2019Abbaye de Forest.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 364","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"BRASS - Centre Culturel de Forest","address_street_name":"Van Volxemlaan","address_street_number":"364","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebrass.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lebrass.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 332 40 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Van Volxemlaan, 364","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"Brass, cultureel centrum van Vorst, staat open voor de buurt en heeft een duidelijke voorliefde voor stedelijke kunst en alternatieve muziekgenres. BRASS kapitaliseert de lokale energie\u00ebn en interculturele, artistieke en maatschappelijke initiatieven in Vorst en het zuiden van Brussel. In die hoedanigheid is BRASS betrokken bij de organisatie van Kunstenaarsparcours, Festival SuperVlieg \/ SuperMouche en het toekomstige muziekfestival in het Park van Vorst.  Het hele jaar door biedt het centrum concerten, voorstellingen, tentoonstellingen, workshops, open podia, bijeenkomsten van inwoners en performances, alsook tentoonstellingen en residenties in de Abdij van Vorst, toekomstige cultureel centrum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],