ouvoirs publics\u00a0et aux\u00a0entreprises\u00a0sous forme de\u00a0services\u00a0et de\u00a0solutions \u00ab\u00a0sur mesure\u00a0\u00bb. Notre but principal\u00a0:\u00a0r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 vos besoins et contribuer ainsi \u00e0 une\u00a0meilleure qualit\u00e9 de vie\u00a0!\n--\nToute l\u2019ann\u00e9e, Pro Velo vous propose des balades guid\u00e9es \u00e0 v\u00e9lo sur demande ou \u00e0 des dates programm\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles et en Wallonie. Gastronomie, architecture, histoire, projet durable\u2026 autant de th\u00e9matiques qui vous feront (re)d\u00e9couvrir votre r\u00e9gion sous un autre regard\u00a0!\nPro Velo promeut un tourisme de qualit\u00e9, local, durable et responsable en utilisant le v\u00e9lo comme outil de d\u00e9couverte, de bien-\u00eatre et de partage. \nSuivez notre guide en famille, entre amis, coll\u00e8gues ou en solo\u00a0!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Dublin","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Dublin, 19","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Dublinstraat","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Dublinstraat, 19","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Pro Velo kan je helpen de overstap te maken naar actieve mobiliteit en fietsen.\nSinds 1992 biedt ons team professionele ondersteuning aan particulieren, overheden en bedrijven in de vorm van diensten en oplossingen op maat. Ons hoofddoel: voldoen aan uw behoeften en bijdragen tot een betere levenskwaliteit!\n--\nHet hele jaar door biedt Pro Velo begeleide fietstochten op aanvraag of op geplande data in Brussel en Walloni\u00eb. Gastronomie, architectuur, geschiedenis, duurzame ontwikkeling... dit zijn slechts enkele van de thema's die u in staat zullen stellen om uw regio vanuit een andere invalshoek te (her)ontdekken!\nPro Velo promoot kwaliteitsvol, lokaal, duurzaam en verantwoord toerisme, met de fiets als middel om te ontdekken, te genieten en te delen. \nVolg onze gids met je familie, vrienden, collega's of alleen!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":40319,"location":{"lat":50.83710821,"lon":4.36720312},"last_updated_at":"2025-02-20T12:18:15+01:00","published_at":"2023-04-18T08:26:19+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/5dcf9db5173f0248dd67a534cf4dd9010b85e67b.jpg","width":1199,"height":800,"ratio":1.5,"oEmbed_height":800,"oEmbed_width":1199,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Schaerbeek, fleuron de l'Art d\u00e9co","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2025-03-29","doors":"13:30:00","start":"13:30:00","end":"17:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":fals