"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"pt":{"name":"Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co - Salon des restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"en":{"name":"Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co - Salon des restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"On Saturday 29 and Sunday 30 March 2025, the 10th edition of the Art Nouveau and Art Deco Objects Fair will take place in a superb Art Nouveau school complex built by Henri Jacobs (1907-1922). The fair will be accompanied by an exhibition of heritage restorers and, on Sunday, a day of expert appraisals by Jean-Jacques Wattel and Art Research Paris. \nAssociations dedicated to raising awareness of Brussels' heritage will also be present over the two days. Around fifty collectors and dealers will be selling objects, small pieces of furniture, books, posters and more. Techniques such as glass, silversmithing, publishing and ceramics will be particularly well represented.\nPractical information:\n29\/03\/2025 from 12pm to 9pm and Sunday 30\/03\/2025 from 10am to 6pm\nPrice (payment on site in cash + QR\/code) :\n\n- Free on presentation of BANAD pass \n- Saturday \u20ac10\n- Sunday \u20ac5\n- Article 27 price: \u20ac1.25 \n\nAddress: School n\u00b013 - Avenue de Roodebeek 103 - 1030 Brussels\nBus 21, 28, 29, 79 (Diamant), 61, 63 (de Jamblinne de Meux), Tram 7, 25 (Diamant)\n\nReservations are not required. \n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"it":{"name":"Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co - Salon des restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"cn":{"name":"Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co - Salon des restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"fr":{"name":"Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co - Salon des restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Le Samedi 29 et dimanche 30 mars 2025, se d\u00e9roulera la 10e \u00e9dition de la Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co dans le cadre d'un superbe complexe scolaire Art nouveau construit par Henri Jacobs (1907-1922). La foire sera doubl\u00e9e d'un salon de restaurateurs du patrimoine et, le dimanche, d'une journ\u00e9e d'expertises assur\u00e9es par Jean-Jacques Wattel et Art Research Paris . \nDes associations de sensibilisation au patrimoine bruxellois seront \u00e9galement pr\u00e9sentes durant les deux jours. Environ cinquante collectionneurs et marchands pr\u00e9senteront \u00e0 la vente des objets, petits meubles, livres, affiches... Des techniques telles que le verre, l'orf\u00e8vrerie, l'\u00e9dition et la c\u00e9ramique seront particuli\u00e8rement bien repr\u00e9sent\u00e9es.\nInformations pratiques :\n29\/03\/2025 de 12h \u00e0 21h et le dimanche 30\/03\/2025 de 10h \u00e0 18h\nPrix (paiement sur place en esp\u00e8ces + QR\/code) :\n\n- Gratuit sur pr\u00e9sentation du pass BANAD \n- Samedi 10\u20ac\n- Dimanche 5\u20ac\n- Prix Article 27 : 1,25\u20ac \n\nAdresse : \u00c9cole n\u00b013 - Avenue de Roodebeek 103 - 1030 Bruxelles\nBus 21, 28, 29, 79 (Diamant), 61, 63 (de Jamblinne de Meux), Tram 7, 25 (Diamant)\n\nIl n'est pas n\u00e9cessaire de r\u00e9server. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"sp":{"name":"Foire d'objets Art nouveau et Art D\u00e9co - Salon des restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"},"nl":{"name":"Beurs art nouveau & art deco - Salon van restaurateurs - Expertises","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Op zaterdag 29 en zondag 30 maart 2025 vindt de 10de editie van de Art Nouveau en Art Deco Objectenbeurs plaats in een prachtig Art Nouveau scholencomplex gebouwd door Henri Jacobs (1907-1922). De beurs gaat gepaard met een tentoonstelling van erfgoedrestaurateurs en, op zondag, een dag van expertises door Jean-Jacques Wattel en Art Research Paris. \nVerenigingen die zich inzetten voor de bewustwording van het Brusselse erfgoed zullen ook aanwezig zijn op beide dagen. Een vijftigtal verzamelaars en handelaars zullen voorwerpen, kleine meubelstukken, boeken, posters en meer verkopen. Technieken zoals glas, edelsmeedkunst, uitgeverij en keramiek zullen bijzonder goed vertegenwoordigd zijn.\nPraktische informatie:\n29\/03\/2025 van 12u tot 21u en zondag 30\/03\/2025 van 10u tot 18u\nPrijs (betaling ter plaatse contant + QR\/code) :\n\n- Gratis op vertoon van BANAD pas \n- Zaterdag \u20ac10\n- Zondag \u20ac5\n- Artikel 27 prijs: \u20ac1,25 \n\nAdres: School n\u00b013 - Roodebeeklaan 103 - 1030 Brussel\nBus 21, 28, 29, 79 (Diamant), 61, 63 (de Jamblinne de Meux), Tram 7, 25 (Diamant)\n\nReserveren is niet nodig. \n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/","email":"cecile8968@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 22 92 28","phone_booking":"+32 478 22 92 28","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004940"}},"place":{"id":276572,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ecole 13","address_street_name":"Avenue de Roodebeek","address_street_number":"103","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue de Roodebeek, 103","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Ecole 13","address_street_name":"Avenue de Roodebeek","address_street_number":"103","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue de Roodebeek, 103","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Ecole 13","address_street_name":"Avenue de Roodebeek","address_street_number":"103","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue de Roodebeek, 103","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"vi