and Mrs. Edmond Seulen. The woodwork, fireplaces, wrought iron grilles and magnificent stained glass skylights that provide abundant natural light have been preserved. Today, the building is home to the British International School of Brussels which has been providing education to English-speaking children aged 3 to 11 since 2000. The children benefit from the beautiful setting and add their own touch and drawings, demonstrating how this building is occupied and still appreciated at present.\n\nArch. Jules LIBOIS, 1930","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/en\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006512"},"it":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Seulen House (The British International School of Brussels)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006512"},"cn":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Seulen House (The British International School of Brussels)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006512"},"fr":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Maison Seulen (The British International School of Brussels)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De style Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 tendance floral, cet h\u00f4tel de ma\u00eetre fut con\u00e7u par l'architecte Jules Libois en 1930 pour Monsieur et Madame Edmond Seulen. La menuiserie, les chemin\u00e9es, les grilles en fer forg\u00e9 ou les remarquables lanterneaux en vitrail ouvrag\u00e9 offrant un abondant \u00e9clairage naturel ont \u00e9t\u00e9 conserv\u00e9s. Aujourd'hui, la maison abrite The British International School of Brussels qui offre, depuis l'an 2000, un enseignement aux enfants anglophones \u00e2g\u00e9s de 3 \u00e0 11 ans. Profitant de ce cadre original, les enfants continuent \u00e0 lui donner vie en y ajoutant de nombreux dessins, illustrant l'occupation contemporaine de ce b\u00e2timent, toujours appr\u00e9ci\u00e9.\n\nArch. Jules LIBOIS, 1930","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006512"},"sp":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Seulen House (The British International School of Brussels)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/fr\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006512"},"nl":{"name":"BANAD Festival - Woning Seulen (The British International School of Brussels)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Arch. Jules LIBOIS, 1930","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.banad.brussels\/nl\/","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006512"}},"place":{"id":50002915,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison Seulen (The British International School of Brussels)","address_street_name":"Avenue Emile Max","address_street_number":"163","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Emile Max, 163","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort