ard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre, 3","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"Brussels Chatterguides : an irresistible invitation to discover and love Brussels!\nAccompanied by a Chatterguide, discover the many facets of Brussels: from the Grand Place to Art Nouveau neighborhoods, from chocolate to Belgian beers, from Bruegel to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u00ab belgitude \u00bb).\n\n-  In Brussels for the first time?  in a few hours, by bus or on foot, we will show you the highlights and let you sample the spirit of the town\n- You believe you already know the city? Let us surprise you with our thematic tours and  neighborhoods\u2019 discovery (more than a hundred!)\n- Organizing a private or business trip or event? Your groups will love our guided tours, tastings and walking dinners ... and you too because we aim to exceed your expectations and take care of everything !\nSince 1983: talkative, experienced and enthusiastic.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Chatterguides","address_street_name":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bruxellesbavard.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellesbavard.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 673 18 35","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1170","address_city":"Watermael-Boitsfort","address_line1":"Avenue du Bois de la Cambre, 3","address_line2":"1170 Watermael-Boitsfort","description_web":"Brussels Chatterguides : an irresistible invitation to discover and love Brussels!\nAccompanied by a Chatterguide, discover the many facets of Brussels: from the Grand Place to Art Nouveau neighborhoods, from chocolate to Belgian beers, from Bruegel to comics, taste all the flavors of the local culture (known as \u00ab belg